(95695, 3794, 811, '<td valign="top">Cool picture.  Only two things -- it seems to have a slight yellowish cast on the left side, and I think the phone needs to be in some and angled with the bottom going to the right.  It looks like it is out of the frame almost, and that makes it seem unbalanced to me. karmat</td>', 'Cool picture.  Only two things -- it seems to have a slight yellowish cast on the left side, and I think the phone needs to be in some and angled with the bottom going to the right.  It looks like it is out of the frame almost, and that makes it seem unbalanced to me. karmat', '2002-08-02 17:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
