(95702, 3796, 2928, '<td valign="top">I like the artyness (is that a word - it is now) of this picture. But I''m unsure about the corporate content.  But, I cant fault the picture, I like it, so I''m going to give it a good mark...</td>', 'I like the artyness (is that a word - it is now) of this picture. But I''m unsure about the corporate content.  But, I cant fault the picture, I like it, so I''m going to give it a good mark...', '2002-07-29 18:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
