(95720, 3797, 210, '<td valign="top">I think the lighting hurts this photo.  It''s neither gloomy or bright, but rather just... bland?</td>', 'I think the lighting hurts this photo.  It''s neither gloomy or bright, but rather just... bland?', '2002-07-30 18:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95721, 3797, 1005, '<td valign="top">Second photo I have commented along this line today!  The other one was too jumbled (too many elements to really focus on), so in that respect, this is better.  I think I figured out what would make me really happy with this shot.  Circle in red the stocks you wanted to contact your broker about (add interest).  It wouldn''t matter if it were your stocks, you really can''t see that level of detail anyway.  Drink your drink down, you''re upset, remember?  8 Swash</td>', 'Second photo I have commented along this line today!  The other one was too jumbled (too many elements to really focus on), so in that respect, this is better.  I think I figured out what would make me really happy with this shot.  Circle in red the stocks you wanted to contact your broker about (add interest).  It wouldn''t matter if it were your stocks, you really can''t see that level of detail anyway.  Drink your drink down, you''re upset, remember?  8 Swash', '2002-07-30 20:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95722, 3797, 2109, '<td valign="top">Finally, a photo that doesn''t have the word fraud in it!</td>', 'Finally, a photo that doesn''t have the word fraud in it!', '2002-07-30 22:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95723, 3797, 1169, '<td valign="top">nice  phone and tea</td>', 'nice  phone and tea', '2002-07-31 04:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95724, 3797, 811, '<td valign="top">You have a good idea here, I just think the composition needed to done a little differently.  You have several lines running in the picture.  The headline is horizontal, the other piece of paper is running up to the right and the phone is angled up to the left.  As a result, the eye keeps trying to follow the lines and can''t find a place to rest.  I think if the cup and phone were moved to the other side, and the papers slid to the right about half a frame, it might help.  Then, the phone, paper and headline would form a triangle shape. Just a thought.  karmat</td>', 'You have a good idea here, I just think the composition needed to done a little differently.  You have several lines running in the picture.  The headline is horizontal, the other piece of paper is running up to the right and the phone is angled up to the left.  As a result, the eye keeps trying to follow the lines and can''t find a place to rest.  I think if the cup and phone were moved to the other side, and the papers slid to the right about half a frame, it might help.  Then, the phone, paper and headline would form a triangle shape. Just a thought.  karmat', '2002-08-03 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95725, 3804, 1792, '<td valign="top">Well composed.</td>', 'Well composed.', '2002-07-29 02:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95726, 3804, 2586, '<td valign="top">Could you please make the title a little longer?</td>', 'Could you please make the title a little longer?', '2002-07-29 06:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95727, 3804, 2937, '<td valign="top">Nice B&amp;W picture. Maybe I would have tried to get the card a little bit closer.</td>', 'Nice B&W picture. Maybe I would have tried to get the card a little bit closer.', '2002-07-29 08:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95728, 3804, 2798, '<td valign="top">Good concept and execution but I think you could have got in closer and perhaps pushed the contrast a little further. A stronger light from the side would have added drama too.</td>', 'Good concept and execution but I think you could have got in closer and perhaps pushed the contrast a little further. A stronger light from the side would have added drama too.', '2002-07-29 09:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
