(95743, 3804, 2221, '<td valign="top">the title is way too long. why explain it so much. the photo is able to tell it on it''s own.</td>', 'the title is way too long. why explain it so much. the photo is able to tell it on it''s own.', '2002-08-04 22:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95744, 3805, 2586, '<td valign="top">Bush Street, that''s S,  isn''t it? If anything the title seems a commentary on the Bush presidency. The picture could be about tourists strolling around the Fincl District or the ubiquity of newsstations, Eyewitness 5. I find the link with the corporate world very tenuous. The pic has a snapshot quality to it, such as the arm and head of the woman in the right lower corner.  The office building in the background, which for the purposes of this challenge should have been the focal point gets little attention. Since you had access tothe financial district you should have had plenty of opportunity to do Corporate World type shots.</td>', 'Bush Street, that''s S,  isn''t it? If anything the title seems a commentary on the Bush presidency. The picture could be about tourists strolling around the Fincl District or the ubiquity of newsstations, Eyewitness 5. I find the link with the corporate world very tenuous. The pic has a snapshot quality to it, such as the arm and head of the woman in the right lower corner.  The office building in the background, which for the purposes of this challenge should have been the focal point gets little attention. Since you had access tothe financial district you should have had plenty of opportunity to do Corporate World type shots.', '2002-07-29 03:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
