(95746, 3805, 671, '<td valign="top">great shot! Excellent composition.</td>', 'great shot! Excellent composition.', '2002-07-29 10:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95747, 3805, 2000, '<td valign="top">Nice combination of signs/labels.</td>', 'Nice combination of signs/labels.', '2002-07-29 13:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95748, 3805, 1658, '<td valign="top">San Francisco, right?  I like the idea (''Bush''), but with the truck and the Eyewitness News van and the random assortment of people, it feels a little too busy for me.  I like shots in the city, and know that many times the people and cars jump into whatever you''re wanting to get a shot of, causing this sort of feel.  I do like the idea, though.</td>', 'San Francisco, right?  I like the idea (''Bush''), but with the truck and the Eyewitness News van and the random assortment of people, it feels a little too busy for me.  I like shots in the city, and know that many times the people and cars jump into whatever you''re wanting to get a shot of, causing this sort of feel.  I do like the idea, though.', '2002-07-29 14:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95749, 3805, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is a fine shot, but it seems (I don''t know) too casual.  Maybe it''s the vast number of varied subjects that confuses this shot.  I really can''t tell what you are "looking at".  4 Swash</td>', 'This is a fine shot, but it seems (I don''t know) too casual.  Maybe it''s the vast number of varied subjects that confuses this shot.  I really can''t tell what you are "looking at".  4 Swash', '2002-07-29 17:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
