(95756, 3805, 811, '<td valign="top">How funny.  Too bad the blond next to the light isn''t facing the opposite way.  then it would look like they were facing four different directions.  The lady(?) in the lower left is annoying, but understandably unavoidable. karmat</td>', 'How funny.  Too bad the blond next to the light isn''t facing the opposite way.  then it would look like they were facing four different directions.  The lady(?) in the lower left is annoying, but understandably unavoidable. karmat', '2002-08-02 17:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
