(95770, 3806, 772, '<td valign="top">wow... this image speaks many volumes to me... first of all, i love the contrasts.  The black and white was an excellent choice for this photo.  I won''t go into my theological relevance of this photo, but I can tell you that it works well for me :)  Croporations swallow a lot of things, including faith, religion, and churches :) = great shot.. one of my favorites this week :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'wow... this image speaks many volumes to me... first of all, i love the contrasts.  The black and white was an excellent choice for this photo.  I won''t go into my theological relevance of this photo, but I can tell you that it works well for me :)  Croporations swallow a lot of things, including faith, religion, and churches :) = great shot.. one of my favorites this week :) - jmsetzler', '2002-07-29 18:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
