(95846, 3810, 2553, '<td valign="top">Fits well with the challenge.  I like the composition.  I''m not crazy about the yellow cast, but honestly am not experienced enough with technical issues to really speak to that.</td>', 'Fits well with the challenge.  I like the composition.  I''m not crazy about the yellow cast, but honestly am not experienced enough with technical issues to really speak to that.', '2002-07-29 14:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95847, 3810, 210, '<td valign="top">Good angle on an otherwise boring topic.</td>', 'Good angle on an otherwise boring topic.', '2002-07-29 16:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95848, 3810, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a neat image.. I like the framing and composition with one minor exception... one ''rule of thumb'' that I try to follow when possible is that a photograph should read like a book... from left to right and from top to bottom.. once again, it''s a rule of thumb and not a requirement by any means.  If you open this image in your photo editing software and do a horizontal mirror, you will see what I am talking about... for some reason, it''s more natural for the eye to move from left to right in a photo than from right to left...  good work :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a neat image.. I like the framing and composition with one minor exception... one ''rule of thumb'' that I try to follow when possible is that a photograph should read like a book... from left to right and from top to bottom.. once again, it''s a rule of thumb and not a requirement by any means.  If you open this image in your photo editing software and do a horizontal mirror, you will see what I am talking about... for some reason, it''s more natural for the eye to move from left to right in a photo than from right to left...  good work :) - jmsetzler', '2002-07-29 18:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95849, 3810, 2337, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot... 10</td>', 'Excellent shot... 10', '2002-07-30 00:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95850, 3810, 2798, '<td valign="top">This yellow caste has to be deliberate. It''s interesting but Im not sure what it has to do with the subject matter. The shelves themselves seem over exposed and there is evidence of sharpening on the words on the edge of the books. Overall I like your subject matter and it''s nice to see some creativity with colour.</td>', 'This yellow caste has to be deliberate. It''s interesting but Im not sure what it has to do with the subject matter. The shelves themselves seem over exposed and there is evidence of sharpening on the words on the edge of the books. Overall I like your subject matter and it''s nice to see some creativity with colour.', '2002-07-30 11:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95851, 3810, 835, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea but I don''t care for the lighting on the shelf</td>', 'I really like the idea but I don''t care for the lighting on the shelf', '2002-07-30 18:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95852, 3810, 2109, '<td valign="top">the tone is a bit yellow, but nice photograph anyway -6</td>', 'the tone is a bit yellow, but nice photograph anyway -6', '2002-07-30 22:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95853, 3810, 3014, '<td valign="top">I wonder what the year 2002 volumes will look like... In fact, I think a stack of more recent volumes might have been more dramatic.</td>', 'I wonder what the year 2002 volumes will look like... In fact, I think a stack of more recent volumes might have been more dramatic.', '2002-07-30 23:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95854, 3810, 2928, '<td valign="top">Oh, how I hate taxes, so many, so annoying and so complex  a clever and subtle picture that tells a story instantly This picture was (I think) a lot harder to take than it would first seem  you have achieved a great depth of field in what is a very close up image, you have fully captured the essence of the challenge and it''s a great picture (10)</td>', 'Oh, how I hate taxes, so many, so annoying and so complex  a clever and subtle picture that tells a story instantly This picture was (I think) a lot harder to take than it would first seem  you have achieved a great depth of field in what is a very close up image, you have fully captured the essence of the challenge and it''s a great picture (10)', '2002-07-31 06:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95855, 3810, 2146, '<td valign="top">cool</td>', 'cool', '2002-07-31 07:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95856, 3810, 2855, '<td valign="top">Very much on topic!</td>', 'Very much on topic!', '2002-07-31 08:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95857, 3810, 2858, '<td valign="top">Could have been portrait-oriented and called ''Cover you tracks''...</td>', 'Could have been portrait-oriented and called ''Cover you tracks''...', '2002-07-31 09:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95858, 3810, 2815, '<td valign="top">I hate taxes, but I like this photo.</td>', 'I hate taxes, but I like this photo.', '2002-07-31 11:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95859, 3810, 121, '<td valign="top">I don''t know hat colour these books were originall but I am sure it wasn''t anything like this. If you did this yellow thing on purpose then I apologise but it doesn''t enhance the work for me. If not then you needed to choose the correct white balance setting on your camera. You could have corrected the colour in photoshop or similar, I tried it and ended up with dark brownish books with gold lettering, quite natural looking. Alternativly it looks good in balck and whit - very stark and foreboding.  Really nice copmosition and a great idea for the challenge. The shelves are overexposed though and detract from the image. It''s a pity the books aren''t lined up perfectly.</td>', 'I don''t know hat colour these books were originall but I am sure it wasn''t anything like this. If you did this yellow thing on purpose then I apologise but it doesn''t enhance the work for me. If not then you needed to choose the correct white balance setting on your camera. You could have corrected the colour in photoshop or similar, I tried it and ended up with dark brownish books with gold lettering, quite natural looking. Alternativly it looks good in balck and whit - very stark and foreboding.  Really nice copmosition and a great idea for the challenge. The shelves are overexposed though and detract from the image. It''s a pity the books aren''t lined up perfectly.', '2002-07-31 17:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95860, 3810, 2251, '<td valign="top">tax laws=giving loopholes for the rich while the rest of us poor bastards gotta pick up the tab. 50% goes to military spending, i say fuck it. To learn more about the detramental effects of capitalism and statism, go to www.infoshop.org<br/>-Ben</td>', 'tax laws=giving loopholes for the rich while the rest of us poor bastards gotta pick up the tab. 50% goes to military spending, i say fuck it. To learn more about the detramental effects of capitalism and statism, go to www.infoshop.org-Ben', '2002-07-31 19:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95861, 3810, 2323, '<td valign="top">Good idea... I like how the books seem to go on forever.  However, the photo seems to be very grainy, and the shelf is a bit too exposed... perhaps a different angle would help, or taking the photo at a different time of day (assuming this was sunlit) might help.</td>', 'Good idea... I like how the books seem to go on forever.  However, the photo seems to be very grainy, and the shelf is a bit too exposed... perhaps a different angle would help, or taking the photo at a different time of day (assuming this was sunlit) might help.', '2002-08-04 21:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95862, 3810, 2247, '<td valign="top">This pic would''ve been better as a black and white.  But what you did is OK.</td>', 'This pic would''ve been better as a black and white.  But what you did is OK.', '2002-08-04 23:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95863, 3811, 1792, '<td valign="top">Dark area on the left seems distracting.  The rest of the composition is good.</td>', 'Dark area on the left seems distracting.  The rest of the composition is good.', '2002-07-29 02:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
