(95909, 3815, 811, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  I think one of two things would have improved it.  A) more light on the rest of the face so that the nose-light is not so stark, or B) Less light on the face so that it fades to complete darkness and all you see is the nose and mouth.  Not sure how you would do that though.  <br/>Good symmetry.  karmat</td>', 'Interesting shot.  I think one of two things would have improved it.  A) more light on the rest of the face so that the nose-light is not so stark, or B) Less light on the face so that it fades to complete darkness and all you see is the nose and mouth.  Not sure how you would do that though.  Good symmetry.  karmat', '2002-08-03 13:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
