(95922, 3816, 2798, '<td valign="top">A very forced title but a good concept for the photo. Not enough "corporation" in the water reflection, though.</td>', 'A very forced title but a good concept for the photo. Not enough "corporation" in the water reflection, though.', '2002-07-30 09:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95923, 3816, 2928, '<td valign="top">I think the fish in the picture totally spoils what could be a good idea.  The reflection of the building didn''t come through and I had to read the title to get some idea of what you were trying to get across.  I hate being pedantic - after all, I''m no pro  but I also think the image of the building needed to be much brighter and the water much darker  if you see what I mean Hope I haven''t put too much of a downer on your picture, but I hope my comments are seen as constructive, not destructive.  It''s a hard shot to take</td>', 'I think the fish in the picture totally spoils what could be a good idea.  The reflection of the building didn''t come through and I had to read the title to get some idea of what you were trying to get across.  I hate being pedantic - after all, I''m no pro  but I also think the image of the building needed to be much brighter and the water much darker  if you see what I mean Hope I haven''t put too much of a downer on your picture, but I hope my comments are seen as constructive, not destructive.  It''s a hard shot to take', '2002-07-30 10:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(95924, 3816, 2337, '<td valign="top">This is an example of a wonderful shot that I just can''t make a connection to the challenge with... On a technical scale without the challenge in mind, I''d give this a 7 or 8... But I have to take 3 points off, cause I can''t make ANY connection to the challenge here.  I''ll come back and look again later and see if I''m missing something, but for now it''s a 4 or a 5... Giving you the benefit of the doubt, I''ll call it 5.  Please feel free to PM me if you think I''m missing something big here (outside of the title) MyQyl<br/><br/>Ok, took a while but I see it now... I think the problem is the coy look too happy... Popping you back to a 7 :)  real nice shot, just hard to interpute</td>', 'This is an example of a wonderful shot that I just can''t make a connection to the challenge with... On a technical scale without the challenge in mind, I''d give this a 7 or 8... But I have to take 3 points off, cause I can''t make ANY connection to the challenge here.  I''ll come back and look again later and see if I''m missing something, but for now it''s a 4 or a 5... Giving you the benefit of the doubt, I''ll call it 5.  Please feel free to PM me if you think I''m missing something big here (outside of the title) MyQylOk, took a while but I see it now... I think the problem is the coy look too happy... Popping you back to a 7 :)  real nice shot, just hard to interpute', '2002-07-30 19:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
