(95997, 3820, 2798, '<td valign="top">Ok Im the one person that gave you a 9 for this. I really liked it. I assumed that your link to the corporate world was all the overhead cables and stuff cluttering the skyline. It was a night skyline silhouette and it drew the eye nicely to where the message of the picture was. I''m startled that more people didnt ''get'' this picture.</td>', 'Ok Im the one person that gave you a 9 for this. I really liked it. I assumed that your link to the corporate world was all the overhead cables and stuff cluttering the skyline. It was a night skyline silhouette and it drew the eye nicely to where the message of the picture was. I''m startled that more people didnt ''get'' this picture.', '2002-08-07 15:33:00.000000', NULL, 0),
