(96166, 3830, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like this - it makes me think about the way local shops have been forced out of business by the big shopping malls - but we can''t blame the malls - we, as a corporate, commercial society are the ones who choose the malls over the cornershops. I think the photo conveys the message well, and I like the way it''s almost a monotone even though it''s shot in colour.</td>', 'I like this - it makes me think about the way local shops have been forced out of business by the big shopping malls - but we can''t blame the malls - we, as a corporate, commercial society are the ones who choose the malls over the cornershops. I think the photo conveys the message well, and I like the way it''s almost a monotone even though it''s shot in colour.', '2002-08-04 17:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96167, 3830, 2221, '<td valign="top">Finally a photo where the photo tells the story not the title! Very good creativity. The big malls kill the small cornershops. To me it''s not an spectacular technically interesting photograph (apart from the grey tones which support the theme well), but it has a clear message. That''s why I like it.</td>', 'Finally a photo where the photo tells the story not the title! Very good creativity. The big malls kill the small cornershops. To me it''s not an spectacular technically interesting photograph (apart from the grey tones which support the theme well), but it has a clear message. That''s why I like it.', '2002-08-05 00:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96168, 3832, 2000, '<td valign="top">I think I get it, but I still don''t really like it.  This seems a bit flat, and I have to stretch to fit.</td>', 'I think I get it, but I still don''t really like it.  This seems a bit flat, and I have to stretch to fit.', '2002-07-29 13:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96169, 3832, 2553, '<td valign="top">I''m iffy on whether it meets the challenge.  I actually like the texture and the diamond pattern in the shot. lhall</td>', 'I''m iffy on whether it meets the challenge.  I actually like the texture and the diamond pattern in the shot. lhall', '2002-07-29 15:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96170, 3832, 2586, '<td valign="top">This is stretching it. You meant this in a very negative way but one could argue that sanitary sewers are very beneficial to us and therefore corporations....<br/>Not a lot of visual impact here.</td>', 'This is stretching it. You meant this in a very negative way but one could argue that sanitary sewers are very beneficial to us and therefore corporations....Not a lot of visual impact here.', '2002-07-29 16:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96171, 3832, 2764, '<td valign="top">Is it straight or are my eyes off?  It is so close to straight that it ought to be perfest.</td>', 'Is it straight or are my eyes off?  It is so close to straight that it ought to be perfest.', '2002-07-29 20:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96172, 3832, 441, '<td valign="top">grate shot...I suppose you''ll get a few of these puns, nice detail although odd labelling on this item - sanitary means clean/hygienic which some of these corporations certainly aint! - 8</td>', 'grate shot...I suppose you''ll get a few of these puns, nice detail although odd labelling on this item - sanitary means clean/hygienic which some of these corporations certainly aint! - 8', '2002-07-30 08:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96173, 3832, 2798, '<td valign="top">Seems a little "sharpened" to me. Not sure the original focus was so good. Nice contrasts but not overly interesting.</td>', 'Seems a little "sharpened" to me. Not sure the original focus was so good. Nice contrasts but not overly interesting.', '2002-07-30 10:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96174, 3832, 1005, '<td valign="top">Great photo of a man-hole cover.  I do get the title/joke, but it''s still a very loose connection to the challenge, in my view.  To me the two words on the cover are very oxymoronic, like Military Intelligence, that sort of thing.  Visually, I don''t see all that much wrong with this photo, except that beauty type appeal (none existant).  5 Swash</td>', 'Great photo of a man-hole cover.  I do get the title/joke, but it''s still a very loose connection to the challenge, in my view.  To me the two words on the cover are very oxymoronic, like Military Intelligence, that sort of thing.  Visually, I don''t see all that much wrong with this photo, except that beauty type appeal (none existant).  5 Swash', '2002-07-30 17:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96175, 3832, 2352, '<td valign="top">That is funny!  Thanks for the laugh.</td>', 'That is funny!  Thanks for the laugh.', '2002-07-30 21:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96176, 3832, 3014, '<td valign="top">Good title.</td>', 'Good title.', '2002-07-31 03:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96177, 3832, 1169, '<td valign="top">i don'' t understand the corperate part of it</td>', 'i don'' t understand the corperate part of it', '2002-07-31 04:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96178, 3832, 472, '<td valign="top">good light, nice shot</td>', 'good light, nice shot', '2002-07-31 11:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96179, 3832, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good picture...my eyes find lots of little nooks and crannies.   This is clearly metallica yet there are no glaring hot spots, but the lighting is good.  I have to laugh too over the oxymoron here.   Making a person laugh with a photograph is a great thing to do.  I''m giving you a "9" Gracious<br/>P.S.  I changed my mind..."10"</td>', 'Good picture...my eyes find lots of little nooks and crannies.   This is clearly metallica yet there are no glaring hot spots, but the lighting is good.  I have to laugh too over the oxymoron here.   Making a person laugh with a photograph is a great thing to do.  I''m giving you a "9" GraciousP.S.  I changed my mind..."10"', '2002-07-31 17:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96180, 3832, 121, '<td valign="top">Could you have rotated it right a little to correct the slant? Nice observation though</td>', 'Could you have rotated it right a little to correct the slant? Nice observation though', '2002-07-31 17:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96181, 3832, 811, '<td valign="top">Good use of humor.  I think an angle other than straight would have made it more interesting.  karmat</td>', 'Good use of humor.  I think an angle other than straight would have made it more interesting.  karmat', '2002-08-02 17:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96182, 3832, 2932, '<td valign="top">I suppose it would have been hard to make this more interesting.  Possibly a strong light or some reflection.</td>', 'I suppose it would have been hard to make this more interesting.  Possibly a strong light or some reflection.', '2002-08-03 02:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96183, 3832, 737, '<td valign="top">Composition - good<br/>Technical Aspects - quite good<br/>Meets Challenge - title helps<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - good<br/></td>', 'Composition - goodTechnical Aspects - quite goodMeets Challenge - title helpsVisual Impact / Originality - good', '2002-08-04 23:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96184, 3833, 801, '<td valign="top">I think the same thingl: the giants could also fall (the biggest, also), but your picture looks too dark, it''s a pity.</td>', 'I think the same thingl: the giants could also fall (the biggest, also), but your picture looks too dark, it''s a pity.', '2002-07-29 05:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96185, 3833, 1, '<td valign="top">I don''t really understand the shot or how it relates to the corporate world.  As for the shot, s''very interesting lighting, but I think your DOF needs to be increased to focus in all 4 cans...try playing with your aperture.</td>', 'I don''t really understand the shot or how it relates to the corporate world.  As for the shot, s''very interesting lighting, but I think your DOF needs to be increased to focus in all 4 cans...try playing with your aperture.', '2002-07-29 10:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96186, 3833, 2752, '<td valign="top">good use of light .  The foreground hints of a soft landing.  Was that intended?</td>', 'good use of light .  The foreground hints of a soft landing.  Was that intended?', '2002-07-29 16:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96187, 3833, 1856, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cool.  I love the red light.  Although this would ruin your ''crushing'' message, I think it would be neat to do the setup in reverse order.  The crushed cans in front might be a little more interesting (not that this lacks interest).  8 Lisa</td>', 'This is pretty cool.  I love the red light.  Although this would ruin your ''crushing'' message, I think it would be neat to do the setup in reverse order.  The crushed cans in front might be a little more interesting (not that this lacks interest).  8 Lisa', '2002-07-29 23:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96188, 3833, 2791, '<td valign="top">love the situation! :)</td>', 'love the situation! :)', '2002-07-30 06:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96189, 3833, 2798, '<td valign="top">Cool interesting colour and lighting. Very dark though. Not easy enough to see the last couple of cans. I guess they''re supposed to be getting more crushed as they go into the distance. Not obvious enough, though.</td>', 'Cool interesting colour and lighting. Very dark though. Not easy enough to see the last couple of cans. I guess they''re supposed to be getting more crushed as they go into the distance. Not obvious enough, though.', '2002-07-30 09:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96190, 3833, 1175, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  What is Pepsi Max?  Are you in Europe or somewhere else outside of the US? -chariot</td>', 'Interesting.  What is Pepsi Max?  Are you in Europe or somewhere else outside of the US? -chariot', '2002-07-30 20:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96191, 3833, 2350, '<td valign="top">Only thing I can say is I love it.  Such vivid, electrifing colors.</td>', 'Only thing I can say is I love it.  Such vivid, electrifing colors.', '2002-07-30 21:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96192, 3833, 3014, '<td valign="top">Coca-Cola strikes again! The red/blue filter effect is nice, but it doesn''t add much. The depth of field is nice, as is the line of gradually crushed MAX cans. I wonder what this might have been like without a studio background, but rather with a shot of a rival cola distributor in the background.</td>', 'Coca-Cola strikes again! The red/blue filter effect is nice, but it doesn''t add much. The depth of field is nice, as is the line of gradually crushed MAX cans. I wonder what this might have been like without a studio background, but rather with a shot of a rival cola distributor in the background.', '2002-07-30 23:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96193, 3833, 2146, '<td valign="top">nice abstract</td>', 'nice abstract', '2002-07-31 08:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96194, 3833, 2997, '<td valign="top">nice lighting</td>', 'nice lighting', '2002-07-31 12:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96195, 3833, 2983, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, but it''s almost too dark.  Brighten it up a bit.</td>', 'Interesting subject, but it''s almost too dark.  Brighten it up a bit.', '2002-07-31 12:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96196, 3833, 2261, '<td valign="top">Love the colours. Great idea and image.</td>', 'Love the colours. Great idea and image.', '2002-07-31 13:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96197, 3833, 1280, '<td valign="top">Cool lighting.  These cans look, to me, like they are out on the town, and out on the dance floor.  Any pop art fan would love this.  Had there been a little white in the pic, it would be down right patriotic.  Score "8" from me!  Gracious</td>', 'Cool lighting.  These cans look, to me, like they are out on the town, and out on the dance floor.  Any pop art fan would love this.  Had there been a little white in the pic, it would be down right patriotic.  Score "8" from me!  Gracious', '2002-07-31 17:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96198, 3833, 2251, '<td valign="top">who needs the cavaties anyway? To learn more about the detramental effects of capitalism and statism, go to www.infoshop.org<br/>-Ben</td>', 'who needs the cavaties anyway? To learn more about the detramental effects of capitalism and statism, go to www.infoshop.org-Ben', '2002-07-31 18:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96199, 3833, 1944, '<td valign="top">Very nice effect.</td>', 'Very nice effect.', '2002-08-01 00:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96200, 3833, 2928, '<td valign="top">I like this one, but it reminds of a games arcade because of the way it''s lit. Clever use of DOF to pull in a central point.  Overall, not a bad picture - good luck...</td>', 'I like this one, but it reminds of a games arcade because of the way it''s lit. Clever use of DOF to pull in a central point.  Overall, not a bad picture - good luck...', '2002-08-01 18:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96201, 3833, 1005, '<td valign="top">O.K. this is a symbolic message...(But you didn''t do a very good job of it, Pepsi is still out there, advertising like mad!  joke)  Did you want to display the first and last can out of focus?   If so, why?  Suggestion (lousy one):  Could you have gotten a Coke VP out to crush the cans in the pic for you?  I''m not wholly thrilled with this shot, but it ain''t wholly bad either, so I started you as a 7, why don''t we just stay there?  (cause I said so)  7 Swash</td>', 'O.K. this is a symbolic message...(But you didn''t do a very good job of it, Pepsi is still out there, advertising like mad!  joke)  Did you want to display the first and last can out of focus?   If so, why?  Suggestion (lousy one):  Could you have gotten a Coke VP out to crush the cans in the pic for you?  I''m not wholly thrilled with this shot, but it ain''t wholly bad either, so I started you as a 7, why don''t we just stay there?  (cause I said so)  7 Swash', '2002-08-01 20:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96202, 3833, 875, '<td valign="top">I love the focus and colors on this.  How did you do the lighting?<br/></td>', 'I love the focus and colors on this.  How did you do the lighting?', '2002-08-02 00:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96203, 3833, 637, '<td valign="top">I see this as only marginally corporate ; nice image otherwise; 3 sjgleah</td>', 'I see this as only marginally corporate ; nice image otherwise; 3 sjgleah', '2002-08-02 23:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96204, 3833, 3073, '<td valign="top">Got Coke?</td>', 'Got Coke?', '2002-08-03 05:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96205, 3833, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice job.  I really like how the composition leads your eyes from front to back, and the lighting is awesome!  karmat</td>', 'Nice job.  I really like how the composition leads your eyes from front to back, and the lighting is awesome!  karmat', '2002-08-03 12:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96206, 3833, 2780, '<td valign="top">I just thought I would thank everybody for their kind and helpful comments.</td>', 'I just thought I would thank everybody for their kind and helpful comments.', '2002-08-05 04:27:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(96207, 3833, 2907, '<td valign="top">The lighting was done useing a red and a blue filter over a flash unit..??.. I was playing around with a minolta flash unit and some large metz flash filters and lit the whole room up red and blue..just like in this photo... Looks like the local police have just arrived (they use alternating red and blue lights here in New Zealand) hehehe :-)</td>', 'The lighting was done useing a red and a blue filter over a flash unit..??.. I was playing around with a minolta flash unit and some large metz flash filters and lit the whole room up red and blue..just like in this photo... Looks like the local police have just arrived (they use alternating red and blue lights here in New Zealand) hehehe :-)', '2002-08-07 05:43:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(96208, 3834, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, though cropped a little too hard on the top right.</td>', 'Nice idea, though cropped a little too hard on the top right.', '2002-07-29 10:37:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(96209, 3834, 2000, '<td valign="top">If only the tube wasn''t compressed at the end.  Creative, though I''d like to see this more with the light at the end a little closer and bigger.  The companies have, afterall, already declared bankruptcy.</td>', 'If only the tube wasn''t compressed at the end.  Creative, though I''d like to see this more with the light at the end a little closer and bigger.  The companies have, afterall, already declared bankruptcy.', '2002-07-29 14:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96210, 3834, 2295, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept.  Focus is good, lighting is good.</td>', 'Interesting concept.  Focus is good, lighting is good.', '2002-07-29 14:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96211, 3834, 1856, '<td valign="top">very clever....I wish the tube weren''t cropping the 11 though.  7 Lisa</td>', 'very clever....I wish the tube weren''t cropping the 11 though.  7 Lisa', '2002-07-29 15:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96212, 3834, 2195, '<td valign="top">I love the humour..Great Concept</td>', 'I love the humour..Great Concept', '2002-07-29 23:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96213, 3834, 811, '<td valign="top">i think if the interior of the "tunnel" was a little more visible, it would be more interesting. karmat</td>', 'i think if the interior of the "tunnel" was a little more visible, it would be more interesting. karmat', '2002-07-30 00:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96214, 3834, 2798, '<td valign="top">Some strange blueness around the end of the tunnel. Chromatic aberrations? Anyway, good concept - unusual to find good use of negative space with a centrally aligned subject. A good shot for that alone. Shame the 11 is partially obscured.</td>', 'Some strange blueness around the end of the tunnel. Chromatic aberrations? Anyway, good concept - unusual to find good use of negative space with a centrally aligned subject. A good shot for that alone. Shame the 11 is partially obscured.', '2002-07-30 09:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96215, 3834, 2928, '<td valign="top">Scary  Not constructive I know, but it''s clever rather than technical I don''t think I''m too impressed with the actual picture itself (please don''t ask why, because I''m not really sure I know why myself), but it''s a superb idea and that warrants a good score on merit. It reminds me of a billboard add that warns you of something nasty.  Good luck  I hope the other voters are a little less pedantic</td>', 'Scary  Not constructive I know, but it''s clever rather than technical I don''t think I''m too impressed with the actual picture itself (please don''t ask why, because I''m not really sure I know why myself), but it''s a superb idea and that warrants a good score on merit. It reminds me of a billboard add that warns you of something nasty.  Good luck  I hope the other voters are a little less pedantic', '2002-07-30 11:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96216, 3834, 3014, '<td valign="top">That tunnel looks suspiciously like a toilet paper tube...</td>', 'That tunnel looks suspiciously like a toilet paper tube...', '2002-07-31 02:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96217, 3834, 2261, '<td valign="top">Good idea, not so sure about the image. Alot of black around it.</td>', 'Good idea, not so sure about the image. Alot of black around it.', '2002-07-31 13:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96218, 3834, 2251, '<td valign="top">Protects the bosses, but what about the people that have their savings stolen? To learn more about the detramental effects of capitalism and statism, go to www.infoshop.org<br/>-Ben</td>', 'Protects the bosses, but what about the people that have their savings stolen? To learn more about the detramental effects of capitalism and statism, go to www.infoshop.org-Ben', '2002-07-31 18:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96219, 3834, 1467, '<td valign="top">Very creative.</td>', 'Very creative.', '2002-07-31 23:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96220, 3834, 875, '<td valign="top">This is almost perfect.  My only nit is the tunnel clipping the upper right corner of "11".</td>', 'This is almost perfect.  My only nit is the tunnel clipping the upper right corner of "11".', '2002-08-01 18:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96221, 3834, 1005, '<td valign="top">Ha, ha, title and shot go well together.  Nit:  tube almost cut off the 11.  I think this could have been better centered.  Joke aside, not much else to look at, so after the initial look, there''s not much to make me want to return to this pic.  7 Swash</td>', 'Ha, ha, title and shot go well together.  Nit:  tube almost cut off the 11.  I think this could have been better centered.  Joke aside, not much else to look at, so after the initial look, there''s not much to make me want to return to this pic.  7 Swash', '2002-08-01 20:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96222, 3834, 2932, '<td valign="top">sweet!</td>', 'sweet!', '2002-08-03 02:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96223, 3834, 2937, '<td valign="top">Is this really the light at the end of the tunnel? I'' d rather say the beginning of the darkness!</td>', 'Is this really the light at the end of the tunnel? I'' d rather say the beginning of the darkness!', '2002-08-04 10:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96224, 3834, 737, '<td valign="top">Composition - good<br/>Technical Aspects - good<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - good<br/></td>', 'Composition - goodTechnical Aspects - goodMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality - good', '2002-08-04 23:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96225, 3835, 436, '<td valign="top">Okay, first off women who are striving to get through the glass ceiling don''t wear jogging shorts, tap pants or shiny mini skirts with their corporate blazers.  They also do''t wear summer beach shoes to a presenation -- AND break through the glass ceiling.  You''re troubled by a bad flash induced shadow and the blob in the lower left does nothing for the composition.</td>', 'Okay, first off women who are striving to get through the glass ceiling don''t wear jogging shorts, tap pants or shiny mini skirts with their corporate blazers.  They also do''t wear summer beach shoes to a presenation -- AND break through the glass ceiling.  You''re troubled by a bad flash induced shadow and the blob in the lower left does nothing for the composition.', '2002-07-29 14:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96226, 3835, 63, '<td valign="top">The shoes suck</td>', 'The shoes suck', '2002-07-29 15:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96227, 3835, 2923, '<td valign="top">huh?</td>', 'huh?', '2002-07-29 16:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96228, 3835, 117, '<td valign="top">help is that a term you use</td>', 'help is that a term you use', '2002-07-29 20:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96229, 3835, 2, '<td valign="top">I have no idea where this choice of framing came from -- huge amounts of unnecessary space on the right.  Aside from that, it''s really pretty boring.  More detail or more emotion could help.</td>', 'I have no idea where this choice of framing came from -- huge amounts of unnecessary space on the right.  Aside from that, it''s really pretty boring.  More detail or more emotion could help.', '2002-07-30 01:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96230, 3835, 2798, '<td valign="top">This photo wouldn''t work at all without the title. The photo should show that this woman is breaking the glass ceiling somehow.</td>', 'This photo wouldn''t work at all without the title. The photo should show that this woman is breaking the glass ceiling somehow.', '2002-07-30 08:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96231, 3835, 917, '<td valign="top">Turn the flash off when there is a wall directly behind, as the shadow becomes a narrow band around the subject.</td>', 'Turn the flash off when there is a wall directly behind, as the shadow becomes a narrow band around the subject.', '2002-07-30 12:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96232, 3835, 2858, '<td valign="top">Intriguing.The negative space looks kinda...negative.</td>', 'Intriguing.The negative space looks kinda...negative.', '2002-07-30 20:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96233, 3835, 2928, '<td valign="top">I can''t say why I don''t like this picture; from a technical point of view it doesn''t jump out at me and I''m not sure what the picture is trying to convey.  I can''t be dishonest here, but I also can''t offer any real constructive comments because I''m not really sure what''s actually wrong Sorry, hopefully you''ll get better comments than this one... Good luck</td>', 'I can''t say why I don''t like this picture; from a technical point of view it doesn''t jump out at me and I''m not sure what the picture is trying to convey.  I can''t be dishonest here, but I also can''t offer any real constructive comments because I''m not really sure what''s actually wrong Sorry, hopefully you''ll get better comments than this one... Good luck', '2002-07-31 07:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96234, 3835, 3020, '<td valign="top">would look better from waist up, the shorts and sandles are distracting and remove from the photo.</td>', 'would look better from waist up, the shorts and sandles are distracting and remove from the photo.', '2002-07-31 08:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96235, 3835, 121, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand this at all. What is that big dark thing on the left? Why is she wearing sports shorts with her suit jacket? Why is there so much blank wall showing? The lighting is very dull and the colours are flat. No sorry I missed this one completely.</td>', 'I don''t understand this at all. What is that big dark thing on the left? Why is she wearing sports shorts with her suit jacket? Why is there so much blank wall showing? The lighting is very dull and the colours are flat. No sorry I missed this one completely.', '2002-07-31 18:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96236, 3835, 1882, '<td valign="top">Uh.  I don''t really get this.  But I guess there is some obscure meaning to somebody here.</td>', 'Uh.  I don''t really get this.  But I guess there is some obscure meaning to somebody here.', '2002-08-02 09:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96237, 3835, 1005, '<td valign="top">Needs to show more legs!  (ha)  A bit dry, it would have helped to see the graphic she is displaying.  Good focus, composition (I know you couldn''t control this, but it is part of the pic) not so good.  The black thing in the foreground (lower left corner) is distracting, the floor and background are pretty lifeless.  Her outfit seems inconsistant, blazer with athletic shorts?  Challenge scoring  -  I dunno, it is a valid reference.  Her expression is more pleading than anything else.  7 Swash</td>', 'Needs to show more legs!  (ha)  A bit dry, it would have helped to see the graphic she is displaying.  Good focus, composition (I know you couldn''t control this, but it is part of the pic) not so good.  The black thing in the foreground (lower left corner) is distracting, the floor and background are pretty lifeless.  Her outfit seems inconsistant, blazer with athletic shorts?  Challenge scoring  -  I dunno, it is a valid reference.  Her expression is more pleading than anything else.  7 Swash', '2002-08-02 17:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96238, 3835, 811, '<td valign="top">I think if the composition was on the right side of the frame, so she was looking into the picture, it would be better, photographically.  I think this is very funny.  karmat</td>', 'I think if the composition was on the right side of the frame, so she was looking into the picture, it would be better, photographically.  I think this is very funny.  karmat', '2002-08-03 00:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
