(96311, 3846, 2798, '<td valign="top">Quite a few people used this same concept this week. Yours is one of the better examples of it. But the lighting is still not right. You need to decide where you want the viewers eye to go and make sure the lighting supports that. Overall your shot is too dark. Also not enough of the sink is visible for the viewer to know what''s going on.</td>', 'Quite a few people used this same concept this week. Yours is one of the better examples of it. But the lighting is still not right. You need to decide where you want the viewers eye to go and make sure the lighting supports that. Overall your shot is too dark. Also not enough of the sink is visible for the viewer to know what''s going on.', '2002-07-30 08:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96312, 3846, 2109, '<td valign="top">nicely done!  Only one thing I would change... get rid of the $5 US bill, and that would make the $2 US bill stand out against the canadian bills.  It would really make an interesting statement!!!  Well done  -8</td>', 'nicely done!  Only one thing I would change... get rid of the $5 US bill, and that would make the $2 US bill stand out against the canadian bills.  It would really make an interesting statement!!!  Well done  -8', '2002-07-30 22:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
