(96327, 3848, 1005, '<td valign="top">My god, this photo should be in some PC Mag!  Very nice Macro!  As a computer geek (since before it was "popular"), I understand what you are trying to say, as a "general" photo viewer, I could say, great shot of some electronics.  Looks too clean/new to be a production machine.  (PC joke)  With the somewhat loose connection to the challenge (and a starting score of 5), you should be happy to know I am scoring this as a 7.  Swash</td>', 'My god, this photo should be in some PC Mag!  Very nice Macro!  As a computer geek (since before it was "popular"), I understand what you are trying to say, as a "general" photo viewer, I could say, great shot of some electronics.  Looks too clean/new to be a production machine.  (PC joke)  With the somewhat loose connection to the challenge (and a starting score of 5), you should be happy to know I am scoring this as a 7.  Swash', '2002-07-29 18:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
