(96343, 3849, 2000, '<td valign="top">By George, I think (s)he''s got it.  A hair lighter gets you a 10, but a 9 is nothing to sneeze at.</td>', 'By George, I think (s)he''s got it.  A hair lighter gets you a 10, but a 9 is nothing to sneeze at.', '2002-07-29 13:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
