(96358, 3849, 472, '<td valign="top">yea and that vodka will destroy your stomach lining!</td>', 'yea and that vodka will destroy your stomach lining!', '2002-07-31 12:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96359, 3849, 2928, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, I like the overall atmosphere created here, but the composition seems to lack a central element.  This might seem a little pedantic, but the ashtray (in my opinion) should have been the central theme and not the words on the newspaper.  My main suggestion would be to have treated the newspaper like wallpaper. Everybody knows Wall Street and the journal, so only seeing part of the words would not have detracted from the image theme.  Having said that, technically, it''s fine and I really like the lighting.  Good luck</td>', 'I like the idea, I like the overall atmosphere created here, but the composition seems to lack a central element.  This might seem a little pedantic, but the ashtray (in my opinion) should have been the central theme and not the words on the newspaper.  My main suggestion would be to have treated the newspaper like wallpaper. Everybody knows Wall Street and the journal, so only seeing part of the words would not have detracted from the image theme.  Having said that, technically, it''s fine and I really like the lighting.  Good luck', '2002-08-01 07:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
