(96365, 3850, 2700, '<td valign="top">ahh, gotta love the WRX.... nice scenry too... 7</td>', 'ahh, gotta love the WRX.... nice scenry too... 7', '2002-07-29 03:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96366, 3850, 2586, '<td valign="top">The picture tells the story and the title only underscores it in an ironic fashion. This picture is actually horribly depressing but only because it is so true! If you had cropped it out right above the mountains instead of showing all that sky, the picture would have been much more effective because then it becomes almost claustrophobic!! Don''t know exactly why but that empty space on the right lane somehow bothers me; perhaps because it defies the bumper-to-bumper idea. This is not the greatest technical picture because it is an opportunity shot but I find it effective for the challenge.</td>', 'The picture tells the story and the title only underscores it in an ironic fashion. This picture is actually horribly depressing but only because it is so true! If you had cropped it out right above the mountains instead of showing all that sky, the picture would have been much more effective because then it becomes almost claustrophobic!! Don''t know exactly why but that empty space on the right lane somehow bothers me; perhaps because it defies the bumper-to-bumper idea. This is not the greatest technical picture because it is an opportunity shot but I find it effective for the challenge.', '2002-07-29 03:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96367, 3850, 2553, '<td valign="top">OH YEAH.... traffic is definitely what I think of as part of the whole "Corporate" thing, but the landscape throws me off!  I live near DC, so the whole frame of reference is different although that definitely makes it interesting to me. I honestly think I would have cropped out blue car on the right, it distracts me. Also looks just a bit fuzzy to me.  lhall</td>', 'OH YEAH.... traffic is definitely what I think of as part of the whole "Corporate" thing, but the landscape throws me off!  I live near DC, so the whole frame of reference is different although that definitely makes it interesting to me. I honestly think I would have cropped out blue car on the right, it distracts me. Also looks just a bit fuzzy to me.  lhall', '2002-07-29 06:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96368, 3850, 2752, '<td valign="top">the message is good but I think the composition is a little bottom heavy</td>', 'the message is good but I think the composition is a little bottom heavy', '2002-07-29 11:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96369, 3850, 2000, '<td valign="top">No relevance to the challenge that I can see, except metaphoric.</td>', 'No relevance to the challenge that I can see, except metaphoric.', '2002-07-29 15:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96370, 3850, 2295, '<td valign="top">A scene I am all too familiar with.  Focus is a bit soft, lighting is good.</td>', 'A scene I am all too familiar with.  Focus is a bit soft, lighting is good.', '2002-07-29 15:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96371, 3850, 2798, '<td valign="top">There''s no feeling of speed on our side of the road. Perhaps there shouldn''t be but this is screaming to be a contrast shot in my opinion. Us moving fast - them moving slow. Technically - framing is too high - focus is poor.</td>', 'There''s no feeling of speed on our side of the road. Perhaps there shouldn''t be but this is screaming to be a contrast shot in my opinion. Us moving fast - them moving slow. Technically - framing is too high - focus is poor.', '2002-07-30 09:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96372, 3850, 2204, '<td valign="top">Interesting perception</td>', 'Interesting perception', '2002-07-30 15:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96373, 3850, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice sky, and the lines of traffic fit your title.  However, the land looks so peaceful, it looks like a traffic jam in the countryside, rather than life in the fast lane. karmat</td>', 'Nice sky, and the lines of traffic fit your title.  However, the land looks so peaceful, it looks like a traffic jam in the countryside, rather than life in the fast lane. karmat', '2002-07-30 17:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
