(96375, 3850, 2109, '<td valign="top">Other than the title, I don''t think this meets the challenge.  For example, if it was titled "highway", it wouldn''t float.  I ignore titles when scoring a photo.</td>', 'Other than the title, I don''t think this meets the challenge.  For example, if it was titled "highway", it wouldn''t float.  I ignore titles when scoring a photo.', '2002-07-30 22:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
