(96401, 3852, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute joke title.  With title I could go 6, without title, at most 4.  This is a very, very good tent shot.  Let''s split the difference and call this a 5.  Swash</td>', 'Cute joke title.  With title I could go 6, without title, at most 4.  This is a very, very good tent shot.  Let''s split the difference and call this a 5.  Swash', '2002-07-29 18:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
