(96477, 3856, 2000, '<td valign="top">Going for the greed angle.  OK.  But the line in the upper third detracts, and I think this may be better if the watch were moved to the left just a bit to decenter it.</td>', 'Going for the greed angle.  OK.  But the line in the upper third detracts, and I think this may be better if the watch were moved to the left just a bit to decenter it.', '2002-07-29 13:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96478, 3856, 811, '<td valign="top">the dark line in the background kinda distracts me, but not bad.  To me, and it is just my opinion, it seems to need to be tilted the other way, or turned the other way.  not sure.  I like the black and white. karmat</td>', 'the dark line in the background kinda distracts me, but not bad.  To me, and it is just my opinion, it seems to need to be tilted the other way, or turned the other way.  not sure.  I like the black and white. karmat', '2002-07-29 15:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96479, 3856, 2928, '<td valign="top">Stark, just stark...  It asks (to me) the question - do you hate the owner for having it or do you want one yourself?  Great picture, great idea, great picture!</td>', 'Stark, just stark...  It asks (to me) the question - do you hate the owner for having it or do you want one yourself?  Great picture, great idea, great picture!', '2002-07-29 18:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
