(96481, 3856, 2798, '<td valign="top">It''s the photo that''s supposed to fit the subject of the week - not the title. Sure it''s a great picture of a rolex. Good contrast and focus. Well lit. But tying it to the challenge just by the title is way too tenuous.</td>', 'It''s the photo that''s supposed to fit the subject of the week - not the title. Sure it''s a great picture of a rolex. Good contrast and focus. Well lit. But tying it to the challenge just by the title is way too tenuous.', '2002-07-30 09:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
