(96483, 3856, 2109, '<td valign="top">Its a picture of a watch.  Other than the title, it doesn''t really convey an image reflecting the challenge.  Sorry, but I have to give it a 1</td>', 'Its a picture of a watch.  Other than the title, it doesn''t really convey an image reflecting the challenge.  Sorry, but I have to give it a 1', '2002-07-30 22:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
