(96485, 3856, 1521, '<td valign="top">it''s for more than a rolex</td>', 'it''s for more than a rolex', '2002-07-31 15:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96486, 3856, 1280, '<td valign="top">I can see the Philosophical connection to the challenge.  The love of money is the root of all evil.  You chose to do it with a readily accepted status symbol.  Your use of symbolism is well chosen.  I am not really skilled enough to give the best technical insights but I''m sure others will share that part with you.  The crease, or lne running across the horizon detracts. I think maybe the light and shadows could be experimented with or toned down a bit.  Over all I''m giving you a  6.  Gracious</td>', 'I can see the Philosophical connection to the challenge.  The love of money is the root of all evil.  You chose to do it with a readily accepted status symbol.  Your use of symbolism is well chosen.  I am not really skilled enough to give the best technical insights but I''m sure others will share that part with you.  The crease, or lne running across the horizon detracts. I think maybe the light and shadows could be experimented with or toned down a bit.  Over all I''m giving you a  6.  Gracious', '2002-07-31 16:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
