(96521, 3860, 2195, '<td valign="top">positioned in the lower left hand side IMO would help to convey your title more...but these things don''t stay in one place very long to give you time to compose :)  -6</td>', 'positioned in the lower left hand side IMO would help to convey your title more...but these things don''t stay in one place very long to give you time to compose :)  -6', '2002-07-30 09:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
