(96550, 3862, 1859, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, but the photo looks sharply out of focus to me.</td>', 'Cute idea, but the photo looks sharply out of focus to me.', '2002-07-30 17:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96551, 3862, 2109, '<td valign="top">The reflections on the mug are a bit distracting... but you''ve got a good concept here.  Perhaps you should spend some time working to perfect this idea.  -6</td>', 'The reflections on the mug are a bit distracting... but you''ve got a good concept here.  Perhaps you should spend some time working to perfect this idea.  -6', '2002-07-30 22:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96552, 3862, 472, '<td valign="top">good concept!~  ill take some of those!  your focus hurts you tho, and the tilted shot.</td>', 'good concept!~  ill take some of those!  your focus hurts you tho, and the tilted shot.', '2002-07-31 11:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96553, 3862, 2983, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  Well composed, good technique</td>', 'Nice photo.  Well composed, good technique', '2002-07-31 12:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96554, 3862, 121, '<td valign="top">Hoestly! the things people have in their cupboards at home. Wher did you get that mug. Seems like coffee mugs are in this week, at least this one is stuffed with cash to make it interesting.  The subject is well lit and well exposed. I was curious so I took a look at it in Photoshop and gave it a little sharpening treatment which worked nicely, at the moment the logo looks a little fuzzy. I would also like the side of the mug to run parallell wuth the side of the image otherwise it looks like it''s falling over a bit.</td>', 'Hoestly! the things people have in their cupboards at home. Wher did you get that mug. Seems like coffee mugs are in this week, at least this one is stuffed with cash to make it interesting.  The subject is well lit and well exposed. I was curious so I took a look at it in Photoshop and gave it a little sharpening treatment which worked nicely, at the moment the logo looks a little fuzzy. I would also like the side of the mug to run parallell wuth the side of the image otherwise it looks like it''s falling over a bit.', '2002-07-31 16:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96555, 3862, 2928, '<td valign="top">Solid technical picture, great lighting, can''t fault it.  Having said that, I think it lacks something, content perhaps, rather than technical.</td>', 'Solid technical picture, great lighting, can''t fault it.  Having said that, I think it lacks something, content perhaps, rather than technical.', '2002-08-01 18:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96556, 3862, 811, '<td valign="top">It seems a touch overexposed to me and that causes two other problems,  think.  One, the money is a little bright.  Two, the cup is almost out of focus, it seems because of the glare in some spots. i like the idea -- want to loan me a couple of those?  :-) karma</td>', 'It seems a touch overexposed to me and that causes two other problems,  think.  One, the money is a little bright.  Two, the cup is almost out of focus, it seems because of the glare in some spots. i like the idea -- want to loan me a couple of those?  :-) karma', '2002-08-02 23:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96557, 3862, 772, '<td valign="top">nice composition on this one... the coffe mug seems to have a fairly soft focus but i''m not sure if it''s being caused by reflections or not... if u have some loose money laying around, I can profide you with a deposit slip :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'nice composition on this one... the coffe mug seems to have a fairly soft focus but i''m not sure if it''s being caused by reflections or not... if u have some loose money laying around, I can profide you with a deposit slip :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-03 00:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96558, 3862, 2932, '<td valign="top">distracting reflection of -- a laundry hamper?  or is it meant to suggest "money laundering?"  If so, very clever!</td>', 'distracting reflection of -- a laundry hamper?  or is it meant to suggest "money laundering?"  If so, very clever!', '2002-08-03 02:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96559, 3862, 3073, '<td valign="top">I know who''s cup that is.</td>', 'I know who''s cup that is.', '2002-08-03 05:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
