(96562, 3862, 2867, '<td valign="top">I''d like to thank every one who commented on my picture.  I got some great suggestions and will keep them in mind for future contests here at DPC.</td>', 'I''d like to thank every one who commented on my picture.  I got some great suggestions and will keep them in mind for future contests here at DPC.', '2002-08-05 14:56:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(96563, 3865, 2937, '<td valign="top">I like this picture very much. The B&amp;W and the old-fashioned writing gives a kind of antiquated impression. How did you manage the reflection?</td>', 'I like this picture very much. The B&W and the old-fashioned writing gives a kind of antiquated impression. How did you manage the reflection?', '2002-07-29 08:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
