(96639, 3870, 1005, '<td valign="top">I like the color of the burner, and the smoke from the books, but this is a stretch, for the challenge (everybody else is doing it....)   For dumb''s sake :  Cooking the books refers to ledger sheets, not reading books.  (sort of a joke)  What else is in the stew?  (newt of tax collector?)  (another joke attempt)  The pot is almost too dark to view (thank god for the handle).  5 Swash</td>', 'I like the color of the burner, and the smoke from the books, but this is a stretch, for the challenge (everybody else is doing it....)   For dumb''s sake :  Cooking the books refers to ledger sheets, not reading books.  (sort of a joke)  What else is in the stew?  (newt of tax collector?)  (another joke attempt)  The pot is almost too dark to view (thank god for the handle).  5 Swash', '2002-07-29 18:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96640, 3870, 2158, '<td valign="top">An interesting idea, but the picture is a bit fuzzy.  Also I''d have liked to see business-related books instead of novels.</td>', 'An interesting idea, but the picture is a bit fuzzy.  Also I''d have liked to see business-related books instead of novels.', '2002-07-29 20:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96641, 3870, 1796, '<td valign="top">I thought about doing that myself and decided it wouldn''t look good enough to work for the challenge, not with what I was willing to invest into a setup. looks like you tried to keep it simple. too simple for my taste and the quality (focus, colors and choice of books) is pretty low, imho. 4 beegee</td>', 'I thought about doing that myself and decided it wouldn''t look good enough to work for the challenge, not with what I was willing to invest into a setup. looks like you tried to keep it simple. too simple for my taste and the quality (focus, colors and choice of books) is pretty low, imho. 4 beegee', '2002-07-29 23:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96642, 3870, 2791, '<td valign="top">thats real??? ohhhh!!!!!!!!!</td>', 'thats real??? ohhhh!!!!!!!!!', '2002-07-30 06:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
