(96651, 3870, 637, '<td valign="top">i get it, but don''t really think this image was captured well.  I''d like more context... a wider shot.  Perhaps with other books waiting their turn.  perhaps a bigger pot with more books.  4 sjgleah</td>', 'i get it, but don''t really think this image was captured well.  I''d like more context... a wider shot.  Perhaps with other books waiting their turn.  perhaps a bigger pot with more books.  4 sjgleah', '2002-08-01 06:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
