(96658, 3873, 2553, '<td valign="top">Concept (in my mind) - Sad, but true.  As for the shot- the setup seems kind of bland - no "tension" in the shot, and the shadows are distracting.  My eye keeps seeing the flag and the blue stuff at the top, and I keep thinking "texture" - I think I''ve been brainwashed!</td>', 'Concept (in my mind) - Sad, but true.  As for the shot- the setup seems kind of bland - no "tension" in the shot, and the shadows are distracting.  My eye keeps seeing the flag and the blue stuff at the top, and I keep thinking "texture" - I think I''ve been brainwashed!', '2002-07-29 14:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
