(96718, 3874, 2221, '<td valign="top">very very nice photo! captures a nice mood. good angle you''ve chosen. unfortunately there is something which bothers me a lot. te me the photo just screams to be cropped more on the right. the white pillar is so distracting because it''s white and the rest of the photo is more dark.<br/>another suggestion: if you would have moved more to the right, the lines on the floow would have pointed right to the man. at the moment the lines lead to a point right next to him. if they would point directly to him that would have been more effective,<br/>anyway. the photo is still one of my favourites this week. it''s original and has a nice mood.</td>', 'very very nice photo! captures a nice mood. good angle you''ve chosen. unfortunately there is something which bothers me a lot. te me the photo just screams to be cropped more on the right. the white pillar is so distracting because it''s white and the rest of the photo is more dark.another suggestion: if you would have moved more to the right, the lines on the floow would have pointed right to the man. at the moment the lines lead to a point right next to him. if they would point directly to him that would have been more effective,anyway. the photo is still one of my favourites this week. it''s original and has a nice mood.', '2002-08-04 22:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
