(96794, 3877, 737, '<td valign="top">Composition - good<br/>Technical Aspects - good<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - good<br/></td>', 'Composition - goodTechnical Aspects - goodMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality - good', '2002-08-04 23:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96795, 3879, 2586, '<td valign="top">Don''t quite see how the title fits in but what''s in a title? Nice image. Like that blue highlight on the shoe. Don''t care for the washed out area in the top of the image.</td>', 'Don''t quite see how the title fits in but what''s in a title? Nice image. Like that blue highlight on the shoe. Don''t care for the washed out area in the top of the image.', '2002-07-29 04:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96796, 3879, 2000, '<td valign="top">There''s an old addage in the corporate world - create a better mousetrap...<br/>Nice shot, and interesting that the mouse''s name is Trust, and that Trust is being crushed.</td>', 'There''s an old addage in the corporate world - create a better mousetrap...Nice shot, and interesting that the mouse''s name is Trust, and that Trust is being crushed.', '2002-07-29 14:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96797, 3879, 2278, '<td valign="top">I didn''t care too much for this (sorry) until I saw the "Trust" on the mouse - nice subtle irony.</td>', 'I didn''t care too much for this (sorry) until I saw the "Trust" on the mouse - nice subtle irony.', '2002-07-30 00:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96798, 3879, 2798, '<td valign="top">This just reminds me of the old support desk story about the person calling up complaining that the foot pedal on their new PC wasnt working. The idea is good but the product logo is distracting and the background seems overexposed. Good attempt at lighting but overall something''s not quite right.</td>', 'This just reminds me of the old support desk story about the person calling up complaining that the foot pedal on their new PC wasnt working. The idea is good but the product logo is distracting and the background seems overexposed. Good attempt at lighting but overall something''s not quite right.', '2002-07-30 11:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96799, 3879, 2983, '<td valign="top">Good composition.  I wish that blue tinge wasn''t there.</td>', 'Good composition.  I wish that blue tinge wasn''t there.', '2002-07-30 14:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96800, 3879, 3014, '<td valign="top">But what does the shoe symbolize? It''s not shiny enough for a banker or a broker, not bulky enough for a blue-collar worker. So who is it? I get the idea that the dot-bombs are getting trampled. But who''s doing the trampling?</td>', 'But what does the shoe symbolize? It''s not shiny enough for a banker or a broker, not bulky enough for a blue-collar worker. So who is it? I get the idea that the dot-bombs are getting trampled. But who''s doing the trampling?', '2002-07-30 23:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96801, 3879, 637, '<td valign="top">Nice concept; dubious execution; but can''t tell you what i''d do differently <br/>5 sjgleah</td>', 'Nice concept; dubious execution; but can''t tell you what i''d do differently 5 sjgleah', '2002-08-01 06:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96802, 3879, 1, '<td valign="top">Good composure and lighting, I just don''t get the idea.</td>', 'Good composure and lighting, I just don''t get the idea.', '2002-08-01 10:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96803, 3879, 811, '<td valign="top">A little overexposed at the  top. karmat</td>', 'A little overexposed at the  top. karmat', '2002-08-02 18:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96804, 3879, 2247, '<td valign="top">Very creative.  I like it.</td>', 'Very creative.  I like it.', '2002-08-04 22:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96805, 3880, 1154, '<td valign="top">sad, so true in todays world</td>', 'sad, so true in todays world', '2002-07-29 11:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96806, 3880, 1024, '<td valign="top">I like the slight tilt to this photo, it adds to the subject matter by having everything a little "off balance" like that.  I get the feeling that the sleeping homeless man is going to slide off into oblivion...  BAMartin</td>', 'I like the slight tilt to this photo, it adds to the subject matter by having everything a little "off balance" like that.  I get the feeling that the sleeping homeless man is going to slide off into oblivion...  BAMartin', '2002-07-29 12:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96807, 3880, 121, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the way the image is leaning over to the right, if the vertical lines were actually vertical I think it would look much better IMHO.  There is a slight fuzziness to the pic which is not caused by focus problem but by JPEG over compression of the image which causes the unsharp look on the shopping trolley and window bars. The tell tale patterns of this are evident around those black patches on the white pillar to the right of the image if you zoom to 200 - 300 % You may well understand this already but otherwise check out this link which is also in DPC''s tutorials section //www.photoblink.com/info.asp?Article=articles/JPEG.xml   apart from all that though it''s a good subject for the challenge and well exposed</td>', 'I don''t care for the way the image is leaning over to the right, if the vertical lines were actually vertical I think it would look much better IMHO.  There is a slight fuzziness to the pic which is not caused by focus problem but by JPEG over compression of the image which causes the unsharp look on the shopping trolley and window bars. The tell tale patterns of this are evident around those black patches on the white pillar to the right of the image if you zoom to 200 - 300 % You may well understand this already but otherwise check out this link which is also in DPC''s tutorials section //www.photoblink.com/info.asp?Article=articles/JPEG.xml   apart from all that though it''s a good subject for the challenge and well exposed', '2002-07-29 13:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96808, 3880, 2295, '<td valign="top">I thought of the same thing, but couldn''t find anybody to take a picture of...  Focus could be a bit sharper, lighting is good.  I like the angle of the shot.</td>', 'I thought of the same thing, but couldn''t find anybody to take a picture of...  Focus could be a bit sharper, lighting is good.  I like the angle of the shot.', '2002-07-29 14:55:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(96809, 3880, 2000, '<td valign="top">And closed.  Effective.</td>', 'And closed.  Effective.', '2002-07-29 14:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96810, 3880, 2586, '<td valign="top">Fail to see how this relates to the challenge. Seems more a reflection on homelessness which could be caused by substance abuse, abusive childhoods, etc, etc, and maybe also somewhat by corporate ruthlessness. Don''t like the angle of the store and image is out of focus.</td>', 'Fail to see how this relates to the challenge. Seems more a reflection on homelessness which could be caused by substance abuse, abusive childhoods, etc, etc, and maybe also somewhat by corporate ruthlessness. Don''t like the angle of the store and image is out of focus.', '2002-07-29 16:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96811, 3880, 210, '<td valign="top">Compression is weak, the angle is awkward/unnecessary and the composition feels uninspired/uncreative.  I''m probably being picky (as I often am) but I could almost feel the sadness in this image, and that''s what bugs me--the "almost" of it all.</td>', 'Compression is weak, the angle is awkward/unnecessary and the composition feels uninspired/uncreative.  I''m probably being picky (as I often am) but I could almost feel the sadness in this image, and that''s what bugs me--the "almost" of it all.', '2002-07-29 16:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96812, 3880, 2752, '<td valign="top">good perspective on life and picture</td>', 'good perspective on life and picture', '2002-07-29 18:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96813, 3880, 1003, '<td valign="top">this makes me wonder how far away from this i am....</td>', 'this makes me wonder how far away from this i am....', '2002-07-29 21:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96814, 3880, 2337, '<td valign="top">I think the horizon might be a little slanted... (yes, I''m kidding)  Great shot!  Hope you gave him a couple of bucks.  10</td>', 'I think the horizon might be a little slanted... (yes, I''m kidding)  Great shot!  Hope you gave him a couple of bucks.  10', '2002-07-30 00:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96815, 3880, 2798, '<td valign="top">I like the slant on this photo - gives it motion - as if we''re moving past in a car (which I guess you probably were). The focus is a little off, though. And I think I would crop a little off the right too. Overall excellent picture and title. Well done.</td>', 'I like the slant on this photo - gives it motion - as if we''re moving past in a car (which I guess you probably were). The focus is a little off, though. And I think I would crop a little off the right too. Overall excellent picture and title. Well done.', '2002-07-30 09:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96816, 3880, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is a very poignant image that sums up all that can be bad in the world of capitalism.  This is a powerful image of photo journalistic quality.  It is sad, it is harsh and a little too real for my liking.  When the content is this powerful, it''s hard to fault the technical nature of the image, so I don''t feel I should.  Photographs are supposed to talk to you and this one does  without compromise.  I can''t say the content is great subject matter, but it does exactly what it is supposed to do  it wouldn''t look out of place in a documentary magazine and it fits the challenge.  Great work (10) if I could score higher, I would</td>', 'This is a very poignant image that sums up all that can be bad in the world of capitalism.  This is a powerful image of photo journalistic quality.  It is sad, it is harsh and a little too real for my liking.  When the content is this powerful, it''s hard to fault the technical nature of the image, so I don''t feel I should.  Photographs are supposed to talk to you and this one does  without compromise.  I can''t say the content is great subject matter, but it does exactly what it is supposed to do  it wouldn''t look out of place in a documentary magazine and it fits the challenge.  Great work (10) if I could score higher, I would', '2002-07-30 11:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96817, 3880, 885, '<td valign="top">Neat photo.  I like the gritty rawness.  I usually have a conniption over non-parallel lines, but these seem to work well.  Nice photojournalism.</td>', 'Neat photo.  I like the gritty rawness.  I usually have a conniption over non-parallel lines, but these seem to work well.  Nice photojournalism.', '2002-07-30 14:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96818, 3880, 2109, '<td valign="top">we all have to sleep I guess</td>', 'we all have to sleep I guess', '2002-07-30 22:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96819, 3880, 2983, '<td valign="top">The sideways angle is appropriate to the subject. I hope you don''t get too many negative comments about it, since it''s obvious it was planned this way.</td>', 'The sideways angle is appropriate to the subject. I hope you don''t get too many negative comments about it, since it''s obvious it was planned this way.', '2002-07-31 12:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96820, 3880, 472, '<td valign="top">sad but true. mag 99.</td>', 'sad but true. mag 99.', '2002-08-01 23:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96821, 3880, 1467, '<td valign="top">Good angle for this shot.</td>', 'Good angle for this shot.', '2002-08-02 19:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96822, 3880, 811, '<td valign="top">ouch.  good photojournalism.  i assume the tilt is intentional, it does give a feeling of being off-balanced.  did you try bw, just for "mood," though I like it in color as well. karmat</td>', 'ouch.  good photojournalism.  i assume the tilt is intentional, it does give a feeling of being off-balanced.  did you try bw, just for "mood," though I like it in color as well. karmat', '2002-08-02 23:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96823, 3880, 2932, '<td valign="top">the tilt is cool, it gives the illusion that the only thing stopping the Bum from slipping further downhill is MCI WorldCom</td>', 'the tilt is cool, it gives the illusion that the only thing stopping the Bum from slipping further downhill is MCI WorldCom', '2002-08-03 02:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96824, 3880, 737, '<td valign="top">Composition - good<br/>Technical Aspects - good<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - good<br/></td>', 'Composition - goodTechnical Aspects - goodMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality - good', '2002-08-04 23:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96825, 3883, 772, '<td valign="top">this is a neat photo but it doesn''t really say ''corporate world'' to me in a strong way... - jmsetzler</td>', 'this is a neat photo but it doesn''t really say ''corporate world'' to me in a strong way... - jmsetzler', '2002-07-29 01:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96826, 3883, 1793, '<td valign="top">looks nice, and nice play on words!</td>', 'looks nice, and nice play on words!', '2002-07-29 02:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96827, 3883, 92, '<td valign="top">You know you now have laundry money on your hands :) LOL<br/>GREAT job. This sums it up nicely:) = 9 Shiiizzzam</td>', 'You know you now have laundry money on your hands :) LOLGREAT job. This sums it up nicely:) = 9 Shiiizzzam', '2002-07-29 03:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96828, 3883, 2452, '<td valign="top">ARgh! For a</td>', 'ARgh! For a', '2002-07-29 03:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96829, 3883, 2937, '<td valign="top">perfect drops</td>', 'perfect drops', '2002-07-29 08:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96830, 3883, 801, '<td valign="top">good!!</td>', 'good!!', '2002-07-29 09:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96831, 3883, 2503, '<td valign="top">That''s where my money went !!</td>', 'That''s where my money went !!', '2002-07-29 10:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96832, 3883, 142, '<td valign="top">Great technique and message in this photo.  Love it! 10</td>', 'Great technique and message in this photo.  Love it! 10', '2002-07-29 12:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96833, 3883, 2923, '<td valign="top">I like this.</td>', 'I like this.', '2002-07-29 12:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96834, 3883, 2373, '<td valign="top">Really good stop motion. Good job!!</td>', 'Really good stop motion. Good job!!', '2002-07-29 15:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96835, 3883, 2752, '<td valign="top">great shot.  good composition and detail</td>', 'great shot.  good composition and detail', '2002-07-29 16:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96836, 3883, 1005, '<td valign="top">Who would have thought that "Down the Drain" would be the cliche title of the week?  Your''s is by far the best of the four.  I really like how you caught the water droplets in stopped motion.  Very cool.  The bill is very sharp!  Very nice!!<br/>I upped you from a 9 to a 10.  Possible winner here!  Swash</td>', 'Who would have thought that "Down the Drain" would be the cliche title of the week?  Your''s is by far the best of the four.  I really like how you caught the water droplets in stopped motion.  Very cool.  The bill is very sharp!  Very nice!!I upped you from a 9 to a 10.  Possible winner here!  Swash', '2002-07-29 20:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96837, 3883, 2278, '<td valign="top">I like this photo - it is very crisp and I like the composition.</td>', 'I like this photo - it is very crisp and I like the composition.', '2002-07-30 00:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96838, 3883, 2798, '<td valign="top">Definitely the BEST of the "money down the drain" pictures this week. And one of only a couple of people to get a good high value bill in the shot. Lovely motion-stop of the water and a well positioned bill. Slightly boring and overly harsh light. But the technical excellence of this picture pull the score up a good couple of points.</td>', 'Definitely the BEST of the "money down the drain" pictures this week. And one of only a couple of people to get a good high value bill in the shot. Lovely motion-stop of the water and a well positioned bill. Slightly boring and overly harsh light. But the technical excellence of this picture pull the score up a good couple of points.', '2002-07-30 09:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96839, 3883, 2983, '<td valign="top">Good, except for the shadows from the head-on light source (built-in flash?)  If you have no other flash, I find re-directing the built-in flash towards the wall or ceiling with a thick index card works.</td>', 'Good, except for the shadows from the head-on light source (built-in flash?)  If you have no other flash, I find re-directing the built-in flash towards the wall or ceiling with a thick index card works.', '2002-07-30 14:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96840, 3883, 2352, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!</td>', 'Nice shot!', '2002-07-30 21:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96841, 3883, 3014, '<td valign="top">Time to scream! No more down the drain photos, please!</td>', 'Time to scream! No more down the drain photos, please!', '2002-07-31 03:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96842, 3883, 133, '<td valign="top">Very clever!</td>', 'Very clever!', '2002-07-31 08:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96843, 3883, 1, '<td valign="top">Great composure and exposure.  The drain cover is amazingly shiny/clean and has a nice flash to it.</td>', 'Great composure and exposure.  The drain cover is amazingly shiny/clean and has a nice flash to it.', '2002-08-01 10:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96844, 3883, 2928, '<td valign="top">Wickedly impressive camera work, great all round - DOF is tops, exposed to perfection, the water flow is well cool - great picture, it''ll be up ther with the best...<br/><br/>I''m quite interested in what camera was used for this one?</td>', 'Wickedly impressive camera work, great all round - DOF is tops, exposed to perfection, the water flow is well cool - great picture, it''ll be up ther with the best...I''m quite interested in what camera was used for this one?', '2002-08-01 18:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96845, 3883, 472, '<td valign="top">what a waste of a hundred!  good clear shot though. mag99</td>', 'what a waste of a hundred!  good clear shot though. mag99', '2002-08-02 15:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96846, 3883, 811, '<td valign="top">good stop action.  hope the bill dried okay!  seems to be slightly yellow (the picture''s cast) but that may be just me.  karmat</td>', 'good stop action.  hope the bill dried okay!  seems to be slightly yellow (the picture''s cast) but that may be just me.  karmat', '2002-08-02 18:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96847, 3883, 1467, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. The drops are great.</td>', 'Very nicely done. The drops are great.', '2002-08-02 19:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96848, 3883, 637, '<td valign="top">What makes this "corporate"?  For me, adherence to the challenge weighs heavily in my vote.  That''s why this image is rated 3.    Having said that, I like the stopped action of the water, and the good catch of the green in the bill.  I''m ok with the composition.  I''d have done it differently.  I''d have cropped it a little wider, and perhaps have included more than one bill.  Bear in mind that these are just personal preferences.   3 sjgleah</td>', 'What makes this "corporate"?  For me, adherence to the challenge weighs heavily in my vote.  That''s why this image is rated 3.    Having said that, I like the stopped action of the water, and the good catch of the green in the bill.  I''m ok with the composition.  I''d have done it differently.  I''d have cropped it a little wider, and perhaps have included more than one bill.  Bear in mind that these are just personal preferences.   3 sjgleah', '2002-08-02 23:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96849, 3883, 3073, '<td valign="top">Can I clean your pipes. Or your water pipe. Simple, sweat, and nice shadows.</td>', 'Can I clean your pipes. Or your water pipe. Simple, sweat, and nice shadows.', '2002-08-03 05:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96850, 3884, 1054, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, under tricky light conditions. -ClubJuggle</td>', 'Nicely done, under tricky light conditions. -ClubJuggle', '2002-07-29 02:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96851, 3884, 2907, '<td valign="top">Poor use of light... consider backlighting laptop and turning down the brightness of your monitor!</td>', 'Poor use of light... consider backlighting laptop and turning down the brightness of your monitor!', '2002-07-29 03:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96852, 3884, 2295, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2002-07-29 09:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96853, 3884, 2752, '<td valign="top">I find te picture too dark</td>', 'I find te picture too dark', '2002-07-29 11:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96854, 3884, 2553, '<td valign="top">Too dark for me, also does not convey "corporate" to me. lhall</td>', 'Too dark for me, also does not convey "corporate" to me. lhall', '2002-07-29 15:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96855, 3884, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  I would bet that you had to shoot this dark to make the LCD appear, but it makes for a bit of a hard pic to stare at, creates a dark, sad mood, to boot.  Great focus, must be a Sony F707 or manual focus.  I started you out as a 5, but I have talked myself up to a 7.  Have a nice day!  Swash</td>', 'Cute idea.  I would bet that you had to shoot this dark to make the LCD appear, but it makes for a bit of a hard pic to stare at, creates a dark, sad mood, to boot.  Great focus, must be a Sony F707 or manual focus.  I started you out as a 5, but I have talked myself up to a 7.  Have a nice day!  Swash', '2002-07-29 21:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96856, 3884, 1569, '<td valign="top">Did you try putting a few layers of tissue over the flash to add some fill light? This would save the pix on the monitor screen and add some light to the car and laptop.</td>', 'Did you try putting a few layers of tissue over the flash to add some fill light? This would save the pix on the monitor screen and add some light to the car and laptop.', '2002-07-29 23:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96857, 3884, 2798, '<td valign="top">Waaay too dark.  Needs at least two extra light sources.</td>', 'Waaay too dark.  Needs at least two extra light sources.', '2002-07-30 09:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96858, 3884, 3002, '<td valign="top">Clever.</td>', 'Clever.', '2002-07-30 12:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96859, 3884, 2352, '<td valign="top">The lighting could have been much better.  I am not sure of your intent in this photo.  I get it sort of...</td>', 'The lighting could have been much better.  I am not sure of your intent in this photo.  I get it sort of...', '2002-07-30 21:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96860, 3884, 2997, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of subject light.</td>', 'Interesting use of subject light.', '2002-07-31 12:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96861, 3884, 2261, '<td valign="top">Way too dark, and the background image is way over exposed!</td>', 'Way too dark, and the background image is way over exposed!', '2002-07-31 13:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96862, 3884, 472, '<td valign="top">good concept. needs more light on the right side of the keybd/front of the car, though.  mag99.</td>', 'good concept. needs more light on the right side of the keybd/front of the car, though.  mag99.', '2002-08-01 23:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96863, 3884, 811, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, but a little too dark for me on the laptop.  Also, I think the entire composition needs to be to the right, just a touch.  To me, it feels like it is being pushed out the left side. karmat</td>', 'Cool shot, but a little too dark for me on the laptop.  Also, I think the entire composition needs to be to the right, just a touch.  To me, it feels like it is being pushed out the left side. karmat', '2002-08-02 23:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96864, 3884, 2932, '<td valign="top">focal point is too dark!</td>', 'focal point is too dark!', '2002-08-03 02:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96865, 3884, 3060, '<td valign="top">bit too dark...</td>', 'bit too dark...', '2002-08-04 15:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96866, 3884, 737, '<td valign="top">Composition - good<br/>Technical Aspects - good<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - good<br/></td>', 'Composition - goodTechnical Aspects - goodMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality - good', '2002-08-04 23:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96867, 3885, 2003, '<td valign="top">hey - fits this week''s challenge too - 8</td>', 'hey - fits this week''s challenge too - 8', '2002-07-29 02:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96868, 3885, 1054, '<td valign="top">Nice concept but the sun flare washes out the photo and generally distracts from the photo.  At a different time of day or under different lighting conditions this would have been an excellent shot. -ClubJuggle</td>', 'Nice concept but the sun flare washes out the photo and generally distracts from the photo.  At a different time of day or under different lighting conditions this would have been an excellent shot. -ClubJuggle', '2002-07-29 02:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96869, 3885, 2586, '<td valign="top">I like the B&amp;W to underscore the Old Time idea. Don''t like the harsh sun light that washes out the top right and creates those exaggerated and distracting lines over the image.  Would have cropped out the side of the building too to give more emphasis on the Heritage Mercantile, both old, pre-corporate ideas. Am sure you made this shot when out on a drive. Too bad you couldn''t take it early in the morning or before dusk when the light wouldn''t have been so bad.</td>', 'I like the B&W to underscore the Old Time idea. Don''t like the harsh sun light that washes out the top right and creates those exaggerated and distracting lines over the image.  Would have cropped out the side of the building too to give more emphasis on the Heritage Mercantile, both old, pre-corporate ideas. Am sure you made this shot when out on a drive. Too bad you couldn''t take it early in the morning or before dusk when the light wouldn''t have been so bad.', '2002-07-29 03:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96870, 3885, 2553, '<td valign="top">This is more "anti-Corporate World"!  I like the b&amp;w. The amount of sunspot glare is just a little bit TOO much for my taste. Compostition is somewhat uninspiring.</td>', 'This is more "anti-Corporate World"!  I like the b&w. The amount of sunspot glare is just a little bit TOO much for my taste. Compostition is somewhat uninspiring.', '2002-07-29 06:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
