(96873, 3885, 1024, '<td valign="top">I love the old fashioned feel of this photo, not just the subject, or the use of black and white, but also the sight over exposure as though its a photo that had faded with time.  Great job.  BAMartin</td>', 'I love the old fashioned feel of this photo, not just the subject, or the use of black and white, but also the sight over exposure as though its a photo that had faded with time.  Great job.  BAMartin', '2002-07-29 12:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
