(96917, 3887, 1005, '<td valign="top">Excellent mac....(what)...ro (sorry, fell asleep).  On your photo itself, I see nothing really wrong.  On the challenge, it meets the subject pretty much head on.  On the idea of wanting this hanging on my wall or wanting to return to it for another look, I don''t think so, it''s just not very exciting.  Suggestion:  how about cutting out a few more words, like "This is GOD, I will return the Market to normal when you remove your hands from the till" or something like that idea, but much shorter, please.  You could call it, "God''s Ransom".  7 Swash</td>', 'Excellent mac....(what)...ro (sorry, fell asleep).  On your photo itself, I see nothing really wrong.  On the challenge, it meets the subject pretty much head on.  On the idea of wanting this hanging on my wall or wanting to return to it for another look, I don''t think so, it''s just not very exciting.  Suggestion:  how about cutting out a few more words, like "This is GOD, I will return the Market to normal when you remove your hands from the till" or something like that idea, but much shorter, please.  You could call it, "God''s Ransom".  7 Swash', '2002-08-01 20:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
