(96935, 3888, 2, '<td valign="top">The title makes this picture just that much better.  I''d really like to see this shot much closer -- just car sides, drive-thru wall, and arms and bags.  The trees and bushes don''t fit well with the picture.  Good shot.</td>', 'The title makes this picture just that much better.  I''d really like to see this shot much closer -- just car sides, drive-thru wall, and arms and bags.  The trees and bushes don''t fit well with the picture.  Good shot.', '2002-08-01 11:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96936, 3888, 1005, '<td valign="top">It''s a good enough shot (has a just threw it out there look, that is not a good thing, if you planned this shot out, went through the line several times trying to get just "this look", I will gladly take it back.)  The hand of the driver in front of you is in excellent focus (but wait, that wasn''t really your subject was it?)  Counter person, bag and person receiving food not in focus.  Too bad for you I took a second look, you started out as a 7 (good shot, but hadn''t thought it through), after really examining this photo, the best I can go is 4.  sorry, Swash</td>', 'It''s a good enough shot (has a just threw it out there look, that is not a good thing, if you planned this shot out, went through the line several times trying to get just "this look", I will gladly take it back.)  The hand of the driver in front of you is in excellent focus (but wait, that wasn''t really your subject was it?)  Counter person, bag and person receiving food not in focus.  Too bad for you I took a second look, you started out as a 7 (good shot, but hadn''t thought it through), after really examining this photo, the best I can go is 4.  sorry, Swash', '2002-08-01 20:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(96937, 3888, 806, '<td valign="top">The viewer doesn''t know from the photo what day it is - Perhaps cutting "Sunday" out of the title? Otherwise an effective photo, however unfortunate the  truth [ ;0) ] of it may be! I like how everyone''s hands are beckoning for their bags to be passed thru the window ... even before they get there. Sorta robotic!</td>', 'The viewer doesn''t know from the photo what day it is - Perhaps cutting "Sunday" out of the title? Otherwise an effective photo, however unfortunate the  truth [ ;0) ] of it may be! I like how everyone''s hands are beckoning for their bags to be passed thru the window ... even before they get there. Sorta robotic!', '2002-08-04 00:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
