(96962, 3890, 1005, '<td valign="top">Neat trick!  The colors in the shadow are great, subtle, but great!  Your connection to the challenge is less loose than most, so good job there, too.  Was the darkness on both sides on purpose?  I am also fascinated by the "light" edges around the lettering (how?).  8 Swash</td>', 'Neat trick!  The colors in the shadow are great, subtle, but great!  Your connection to the challenge is less loose than most, so good job there, too.  Was the darkness on both sides on purpose?  I am also fascinated by the "light" edges around the lettering (how?).  8 Swash', '2002-07-30 20:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
