(96971, 3890, 2798, '<td valign="top">You were robbed. This and customer dissatisfaction were my only two 10s for this week and I''m mortified that neither placed higher than 50. This was a really creative shot - a really GOOD idea and what''s more the technicals are spot on.</td>', 'You were robbed. This and customer dissatisfaction were my only two 10s for this week and I''m mortified that neither placed higher than 50. This was a really creative shot - a really GOOD idea and what''s more the technicals are spot on.', '2002-08-05 06:22:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(96972, 3890, 2221, '<td valign="top">Many thanks for your very encouraging comments. I posted a photo explanation to the forum <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.asp?action=read&amp;FORUM_POST_ID=18547" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">here</a>.<br/></td>', 'Many thanks for your very encouraging comments. I posted a photo explanation to the forum here.', '2002-08-06 14:28:00.000000', NULL, 0),
