(96975, 3891, 2798, '<td valign="top">What is with the lines on this photo? Over sharpened? Definitely jaggies there. Nice to see a positive slant on a corporate world photo, though. Very rare in this week''s crop of pictures. Subject is a little dark.</td>', 'What is with the lines on this photo? Over sharpened? Definitely jaggies there. Nice to see a positive slant on a corporate world photo, though. Very rare in this week''s crop of pictures. Subject is a little dark.', '2002-07-30 09:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
