(97026, 3896, 2586, '<td valign="top">Nice image and thanks to your long title it fits in the Corporate World challenge category. But only because you say so.</td>', 'Nice image and thanks to your long title it fits in the Corporate World challenge category. But only because you say so.', '2002-07-29 16:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97027, 3896, 554, '<td valign="top">If not for the corporate bosses, you wouldn''t have THAT much bro.</td>', 'If not for the corporate bosses, you wouldn''t have THAT much bro.', '2002-07-29 22:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97028, 3896, 2204, '<td valign="top">Gut wrenching parody.........5</td>', 'Gut wrenching parody.........5', '2002-07-30 02:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97029, 3896, 441, '<td valign="top">ther for the grace of God...monochrome plus contrast would help your message - 7</td>', 'ther for the grace of God...monochrome plus contrast would help your message - 7', '2002-07-30 08:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97030, 3896, 835, '<td valign="top">colors and focus are perfect.  I wish I could do that well</td>', 'colors and focus are perfect.  I wish I could do that well', '2002-07-30 18:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97031, 3896, 2109, '<td valign="top">Technically this is a nice photo, but I don''t think it meets the challenge.  The challenge is about the photograph, not its title.  For example, if this photo was titled "2 guys with hammers", it wouldn''t score.  I''m sorry, but I have to give it a 1 because it does not convey an image reflecting the current challenge.</td>', 'Technically this is a nice photo, but I don''t think it meets the challenge.  The challenge is about the photograph, not its title.  For example, if this photo was titled "2 guys with hammers", it wouldn''t score.  I''m sorry, but I have to give it a 1 because it does not convey an image reflecting the current challenge.', '2002-07-30 22:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97032, 3896, 806, '<td valign="top">This looks like Jamaica... am I close?</td>', 'This looks like Jamaica... am I close?', '2002-07-30 23:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97033, 3896, 2855, '<td valign="top">Very real. I like it.</td>', 'Very real. I like it.', '2002-07-31 08:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97034, 3896, 1024, '<td valign="top">I have grown very fond of this photo.  I keep coming back to it, and the story it is telling.  Very compelling.</td>', 'I have grown very fond of this photo.  I keep coming back to it, and the story it is telling.  Very compelling.', '2002-07-31 13:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97035, 3896, 2337, '<td valign="top">9 ~  I wish I could give it a 10, or give you a reason I can''t, but I can''t do either... I like this shot a lot and from a On Challenge stand point, you are right on target.  A fresh look from a different angle... But there is something technical that keeps me from 10ing it.  I wish I knew enough to be able to point it out to you.  Maybe it is the imbalance of the color, the bright yellow jacket ''out weighs'' the muted purple sweater?  I don''t know, but something about the balance bothered me... I hope someone with more knowledge can point it out.  In any event, congrats on a great image!</td>', '9 ~  I wish I could give it a 10, or give you a reason I can''t, but I can''t do either... I like this shot a lot and from a On Challenge stand point, you are right on target.  A fresh look from a different angle... But there is something technical that keeps me from 10ing it.  I wish I knew enough to be able to point it out to you.  Maybe it is the imbalance of the color, the bright yellow jacket ''out weighs'' the muted purple sweater?  I don''t know, but something about the balance bothered me... I hope someone with more knowledge can point it out.  In any event, congrats on a great image!', '2002-07-31 14:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97036, 3896, 1944, '<td valign="top">Good theme, well done photo.</td>', 'Good theme, well done photo.', '2002-08-01 00:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97037, 3896, 2928, '<td valign="top">Technically fine - but I the message seems (to me anyway) weak.  Sorry it''s not being a bit more possitive...</td>', 'Technically fine - but I the message seems (to me anyway) weak.  Sorry it''s not being a bit more possitive...', '2002-08-01 18:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97038, 3896, 1882, '<td valign="top">Ugh.  Another photo that does NOT fit the challenge.  A tricky title to try and FORCE that, but it doesn''t sit well with me.</td>', 'Ugh.  Another photo that does NOT fit the challenge.  A tricky title to try and FORCE that, but it doesn''t sit well with me.', '2002-08-02 09:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97039, 3896, 772, '<td valign="top">The image doesn''t really say ''corporate world'' to me but the title explains it :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'The image doesn''t really say ''corporate world'' to me but the title explains it :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-02 11:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
