(97062, 3897, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good, colorful characters and prop.  The black background on the left is good. The yellow on the right competes with the subject for attention.  My eye gets drawn there rather than the purples and reds, then it goes to the truck.   Different cropping would have eliminated the distraction. This pic still has appeal though.</td>', 'Good, colorful characters and prop.  The black background on the left is good. The yellow on the right competes with the subject for attention.  My eye gets drawn there rather than the purples and reds, then it goes to the truck.   Different cropping would have eliminated the distraction. This pic still has appeal though.', '2002-07-31 18:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
