(97085, 3898, 2146, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2002-07-31 07:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97086, 3898, 121, '<td valign="top">First of all I don''t get it. Secondly it appears to be a mural painted on someones garage wall/door. If that is the case then all you have done is copy someone elses art.(unless you painted it I suppose)  It appears to have been taken at night and the artificial light has produced unattractive colouration. The top right is overexposed and the bottom is too dark.</td>', 'First of all I don''t get it. Secondly it appears to be a mural painted on someones garage wall/door. If that is the case then all you have done is copy someone elses art.(unless you painted it I suppose)  It appears to have been taken at night and the artificial light has produced unattractive colouration. The top right is overexposed and the bottom is too dark.', '2002-07-31 16:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97087, 3898, 2251, '<td valign="top">I like the symbolism with the beware of dog sign to show how the elite needs someone to protect them from the working class. To learn more about the detramental effects of capitalism and statism, go to www.infoshop.org<br/>-Ben</td>', 'I like the symbolism with the beware of dog sign to show how the elite needs someone to protect them from the working class. To learn more about the detramental effects of capitalism and statism, go to www.infoshop.org-Ben', '2002-07-31 18:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97088, 3898, 210, '<td valign="top">Not to be mean toward the garage door, but I think shot would have been a LOT better if it was of an ACTUAL escalator.  Althoguh, I must admit, the BEWARE OF DOG sign adds a bit of warning that goes well with the current economy.</td>', 'Not to be mean toward the garage door, but I think shot would have been a LOT better if it was of an ACTUAL escalator.  Althoguh, I must admit, the BEWARE OF DOG sign adds a bit of warning that goes well with the current economy.', '2002-08-02 02:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
