(97135, 3903, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wow, very, very cool.  I know you have some sort of message with the bright light below the "necktie", but to me, it''s too bright.  Fabulous idea!  This reminds me of a musician friend of mine.  He works for $$$, but only when he HAS to.  I want to give this a 10, but the light drags me down to 9.  Swash</td>', 'Wow, very, very cool.  I know you have some sort of message with the bright light below the "necktie", but to me, it''s too bright.  Fabulous idea!  This reminds me of a musician friend of mine.  He works for $$$, but only when he HAS to.  I want to give this a 10, but the light drags me down to 9.  Swash', '2002-07-29 20:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97136, 3903, 2352, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, but I am trying to fit it to the challenge.  It is there, but a stretch for me.  I do like the shot though!  Great for a "music to die for" challenge... Creative lighting...</td>', 'Interesting shot, but I am trying to fit it to the challenge.  It is there, but a stretch for me.  I do like the shot though!  Great for a "music to die for" challenge... Creative lighting...', '2002-07-29 22:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97137, 3903, 2278, '<td valign="top">Not sure exactly how this relates to the corporate world, but it''s very creative.  Just too much glare on the shirt</td>', 'Not sure exactly how this relates to the corporate world, but it''s very creative.  Just too much glare on the shirt', '2002-07-30 01:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97138, 3903, 2798, '<td valign="top">Well staged and very interestingly lit. But badly over exposed below the noose. And I''m not sure I understand your concept. But that''s my problem - not yours.</td>', 'Well staged and very interestingly lit. But badly over exposed below the noose. And I''m not sure I understand your concept. But that''s my problem - not yours.', '2002-07-30 09:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97139, 3903, 2928, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting, the noose, the rose etc.  But I can''t see why you have the guitar neck - what has a guitar got to do with a picture that, I think, would be ten times better without it..  I would have given ten for this without the guitar - hope I''m not being to pedantic here.  Having said that I still give it 7...</td>', 'I really like the lighting, the noose, the rose etc.  But I can''t see why you have the guitar neck - what has a guitar got to do with a picture that, I think, would be ten times better without it..  I would have given ten for this without the guitar - hope I''m not being to pedantic here.  Having said that I still give it 7...', '2002-07-30 09:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97140, 3903, 885, '<td valign="top">Weird image.  The guitar dressed up in a suit is really creative.  I get the noose thing, but I''m a little confused about the bright light there...I''ll assume it''s intentional, but I don''t know what it''s trying to say.  And in this sort of story photo it seems like it ought to be saying something.  I don''t like the purple sequined background...I think it should either be more out of focus or be a plainer black or dark grey or something.  If this were my photo I probably would have titled it "Napster" :-)</td>', 'Weird image.  The guitar dressed up in a suit is really creative.  I get the noose thing, but I''m a little confused about the bright light there...I''ll assume it''s intentional, but I don''t know what it''s trying to say.  And in this sort of story photo it seems like it ought to be saying something.  I don''t like the purple sequined background...I think it should either be more out of focus or be a plainer black or dark grey or something.  If this were my photo I probably would have titled it "Napster" :-)', '2002-07-30 14:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97141, 3903, 3014, '<td valign="top">As a music-lover, I couldn''t agree more. As a photographer, I like the contrats of the glitter, the blue-collar shirt, and the guitar versus the suit, rose and ''necktie'' -- WOW! Eloquent.</td>', 'As a music-lover, I couldn''t agree more. As a photographer, I like the contrats of the glitter, the blue-collar shirt, and the guitar versus the suit, rose and ''necktie'' -- WOW! Eloquent.', '2002-07-30 22:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97142, 3903, 1856, '<td valign="top">wow...10 Lisa</td>', 'wow...10 Lisa', '2002-07-30 23:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97143, 3903, 2650, '<td valign="top">Great concept.</td>', 'Great concept.', '2002-07-31 14:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97144, 3903, 1944, '<td valign="top">Very original shot, very well done. I like the lighting effect on the shirt front. One of my favorites this week.</td>', 'Very original shot, very well done. I like the lighting effect on the shirt front. One of my favorites this week.', '2002-08-01 00:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97145, 3903, 637, '<td valign="top">Too abstract a connection to the challenge topic for me... 3 sjgleah</td>', 'Too abstract a connection to the challenge topic for me... 3 sjgleah', '2002-08-01 06:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97146, 3903, 2586, '<td valign="top">Somehow, I thought of having commented on this image earlier this week (and was somewhat negative about how the bottom of the rope was washed out by the light. Now, I see that as a strength to make it more symbolic). Anyway, I wanted to revisit this image. It is a very strong image and I like it more than when I first saw it. Have been wondering how you did that white light surrounding the rope? It''s very cool. Also like the background, the composition and the way you cropped the left. The props you use are very to the point and all represent nice touches. It''s a very artistic image and also very eloquent. It does sum things up pretty well, doesn''t it. I upped the score a few notches and can''t go any higher :)<br/>It''s all right on. Journey</td>', 'Somehow, I thought of having commented on this image earlier this week (and was somewhat negative about how the bottom of the rope was washed out by the light. Now, I see that as a strength to make it more symbolic). Anyway, I wanted to revisit this image. It is a very strong image and I like it more than when I first saw it. Have been wondering how you did that white light surrounding the rope? It''s very cool. Also like the background, the composition and the way you cropped the left. The props you use are very to the point and all represent nice touches. It''s a very artistic image and also very eloquent. It does sum things up pretty well, doesn''t it. I upped the score a few notches and can''t go any higher :)It''s all right on. Journey', '2002-08-01 20:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97147, 3903, 205, '<td valign="top">I''m glad someone had a way of dissing corporate made music. I''m thinking that people most likely have a problem understanding this or that they think that bright light around the noose makes it flawed, I say well done.</td>', 'I''m glad someone had a way of dissing corporate made music. I''m thinking that people most likely have a problem understanding this or that they think that bright light around the noose makes it flawed, I say well done.', '2002-08-01 23:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97148, 3903, 1882, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2002-08-02 09:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97149, 3903, 472, '<td valign="top">i love the light on the rope .. where i think this image falls down is the guitar neck isn'' t with nearly as much interest. would like to see a good rim light picking up the edge of that guitar neck. one of the more creative images :) .. mag99</td>', 'i love the light on the rope .. where i think this image falls down is the guitar neck isn'' t with nearly as much interest. would like to see a good rim light picking up the edge of that guitar neck. one of the more creative images :) .. mag99', '2002-08-02 15:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97150, 3903, 2932, '<td valign="top">excellent job holding together a difficult exposure -- it works to your advantage!  This is a classy shot!</td>', 'excellent job holding together a difficult exposure -- it works to your advantage!  This is a classy shot!', '2002-08-03 02:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97151, 3903, 811, '<td valign="top">Cool.  No criticisms about this one from me, but there are a lot of things i like about it.  The overexposure on the noose gives it a surreal effect and I like the color splash the rose gives.  This is just a very good picture, I think.  karmat</td>', 'Cool.  No criticisms about this one from me, but there are a lot of things i like about it.  The overexposure on the noose gives it a surreal effect and I like the color splash the rose gives.  This is just a very good picture, I think.  karmat', '2002-08-03 11:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97152, 3903, 2247, '<td valign="top">Very original and creative.  I like it because it''s cool and true.</td>', 'Very original and creative.  I like it because it''s cool and true.', '2002-08-04 23:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97153, 3903, 2586, '<td valign="top">Hokie, I am VERY disappointed this picture didn''t do better. I honestly thought it would win. Anyway, it was very artistic and very well done.Outstanding. Please let us know how you did the light around the rope.  Bravo for a superb picture.</td>', 'Hokie, I am VERY disappointed this picture didn''t do better. I honestly thought it would win. Anyway, it was very artistic and very well done.Outstanding. Please let us know how you did the light around the rope.  Bravo for a superb picture.', '2002-08-05 01:19:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(97154, 3903, 205, '<td valign="top">Wow! alot of people didn''t get this photo, thats shocking yet It makes my assumption right.</td>', 'Wow! alot of people didn''t get this photo, thats shocking yet It makes my assumption right.', '2002-08-05 10:55:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(97155, 3903, 734, '<td valign="top">I was just reviewing some of the comments on this photo, and I was shocked by the amount of people who didnt get the connection to Corporate life.  I would have thought it was painfully obvious.  Oh well you still have to agree its a wonderful image.</td>', 'I was just reviewing some of the comments on this photo, and I was shocked by the amount of people who didnt get the connection to Corporate life.  I would have thought it was painfully obvious.  Oh well you still have to agree its a wonderful image.', '2002-08-08 02:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(97156, 3904, 2586, '<td valign="top">Such a long title and actually more confusing than helpful. The charts presumably must reflect the corporate world, graphs of stocks or economic indicators but it could really be graphs of anything. The lighting is too dark and the angle at the top is rather unfortunate; don''t care for the radiator showing. Carpet and napkin on tray rather clash.</td>', 'Such a long title and actually more confusing than helpful. The charts presumably must reflect the corporate world, graphs of stocks or economic indicators but it could really be graphs of anything. The lighting is too dark and the angle at the top is rather unfortunate; don''t care for the radiator showing. Carpet and napkin on tray rather clash.', '2002-07-29 03:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97157, 3904, 917, '<td valign="top">Indoor photography with a flash always causes the background to be too dark. Try getting someone to hold up some silver foil or white card, its a cheap version of those reflective brollies the pros use. Nice subject, I like the humour.</td>', 'Indoor photography with a flash always causes the background to be too dark. Try getting someone to hold up some silver foil or white card, its a cheap version of those reflective brollies the pros use. Nice subject, I like the humour.', '2002-07-29 09:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97158, 3904, 1005, '<td valign="top">Where do I start.....First the shot is on the dark side.  Is that what you wanted?  Is there some sort of message or feeling you are trying to convey?  Next, the background (the floor) is too busy/distracting/takes away from the real subject.  O.K. now what is the cat doing?  I don''t really mean to tear you apart like this, sorry.  Still have to go with a 4, Swash.</td>', 'Where do I start.....First the shot is on the dark side.  Is that what you wanted?  Is there some sort of message or feeling you are trying to convey?  Next, the background (the floor) is too busy/distracting/takes away from the real subject.  O.K. now what is the cat doing?  I don''t really mean to tear you apart like this, sorry.  Still have to go with a 4, Swash.', '2002-07-29 18:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97159, 3904, 2829, '<td valign="top">The picture itself is cute. It might have worked better if you dressed the cat up a bit and put him/her on a table in front of some papers and titled the picture corporate fatcat.</td>', 'The picture itself is cute. It might have worked better if you dressed the cat up a bit and put him/her on a table in front of some papers and titled the picture corporate fatcat.', '2002-07-29 22:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97160, 3904, 2798, '<td valign="top">A very light hearted slant on the subject matter - I really like your idea. There have been so many stuffy, negative images this week. It''s nice to see a fun one for a change. Your photograph needs a little more light to really make the cat stand out. And if you''d got down on the floor and take the picture at eye level with kitty then it might have been more dramatic. Other than that - a good idea and and fun photo. Well done.</td>', 'A very light hearted slant on the subject matter - I really like your idea. There have been so many stuffy, negative images this week. It''s nice to see a fun one for a change. Your photograph needs a little more light to really make the cat stand out. And if you''d got down on the floor and take the picture at eye level with kitty then it might have been more dramatic. Other than that - a good idea and and fun photo. Well done.', '2002-07-30 11:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97161, 3904, 210, '<td valign="top">What the...?</td>', 'What the...?', '2002-07-30 19:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97162, 3904, 2278, '<td valign="top">I wish my work days were so simple!  Keep taking pictures Christian and have fun!</td>', 'I wish my work days were so simple!  Keep taking pictures Christian and have fun!', '2002-07-30 21:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97163, 3904, 1944, '<td valign="top">What a fin idea:)</td>', 'What a fin idea:)', '2002-07-31 00:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97164, 3904, 737, '<td valign="top">Composition - OK. I would have straightened up the cat''s tray<br/>Technical Aspects - good. The rear area needs to be lit a little more<br/>Meets Challenge - sort of. It would have been better to see the chart titles more clearly, maybe added a newspaper.<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - average. No colors jump out.<br/></td>', 'Composition - OK. I would have straightened up the cat''s trayTechnical Aspects - good. The rear area needs to be lit a little moreMeets Challenge - sort of. It would have been better to see the chart titles more clearly, maybe added a newspaper.Visual Impact / Originality - average. No colors jump out.', '2002-07-31 00:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97165, 3904, 1280, '<td valign="top">I''m a softy for anything with four legs. This critter looks like it hasn''t missed too many meals.  :-)  I like how you took the time to set everything up. I''m learning how important it is to carefully plan.  Keep having fun with your camera and with the help  of this site you will see your plans work out.  This is a cute picture.  "5" Gracious</td>', 'I''m a softy for anything with four legs. This critter looks like it hasn''t missed too many meals.  :-)  I like how you took the time to set everything up. I''m learning how important it is to carefully plan.  Keep having fun with your camera and with the help  of this site you will see your plans work out.  This is a cute picture.  "5" Gracious', '2002-07-31 16:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97166, 3904, 121, '<td valign="top">Not a bad effort for a 12 year old, you need to learn how to get lighting sorted out in your photos, this one is way too dark. Maybe a less busy background would help also. Nice idea with the cat ( I hope he doesn''t mind you implying he is a fat cat) does he/she always get fed off a silver tray?</td>', 'Not a bad effort for a 12 year old, you need to learn how to get lighting sorted out in your photos, this one is way too dark. Maybe a less busy background would help also. Nice idea with the cat ( I hope he doesn''t mind you implying he is a fat cat) does he/she always get fed off a silver tray?', '2002-07-31 17:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97167, 3904, 472, '<td valign="top">good job, christian!  keep taking pics.  cute kitty !!! :)  .. mag99</td>', 'good job, christian!  keep taking pics.  cute kitty !!! :)  .. mag99', '2002-08-01 23:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97168, 3904, 811, '<td valign="top">this is a great idea.  the only suggestion i would make is to get the camera down lower and make the shot so that you can see more of the cat''s face.  Great idea.  karmat</td>', 'this is a great idea.  the only suggestion i would make is to get the camera down lower and make the shot so that you can see more of the cat''s face.  Great idea.  karmat', '2002-08-02 17:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
