(97186, 3906, 772, '<td valign="top">This is sorta strange... I expected to see tall building shots this week and I expected to see quite a few of them.   It also seems strange that, for some reason, I like the execution on these much better than some of the other shots I have seen so far.  I don''t know if you thought this may turn out to be ''cliche'' or not, but I will have to say ''kudos'' on a great shot.  Even if a shot turns out to be ''cliche'' in a given challenge (which this one is not really cliche), excellent execution will still score very nicely... good work... - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is sorta strange... I expected to see tall building shots this week and I expected to see quite a few of them.   It also seems strange that, for some reason, I like the execution on these much better than some of the other shots I have seen so far.  I don''t know if you thought this may turn out to be ''cliche'' or not, but I will have to say ''kudos'' on a great shot.  Even if a shot turns out to be ''cliche'' in a given challenge (which this one is not really cliche), excellent execution will still score very nicely... good work... - jmsetzler', '2002-07-29 12:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
