(97191, 3906, 2928, '<td valign="top">This challenge has been a close battle; many of the pictures have been a high standard of invention and drama, both positive and negative.  This picture shows great drama in its composition and is technically very good.  I''m no pro, but I know what I like and if I had to pick from the best  it would be up there.  Great shot, great drama and great sense of scale, it''s a top notch photo with add-ons (10) Good luck with a really great picture</td>', 'This challenge has been a close battle; many of the pictures have been a high standard of invention and drama, both positive and negative.  This picture shows great drama in its composition and is technically very good.  I''m no pro, but I know what I like and if I had to pick from the best  it would be up there.  Great shot, great drama and great sense of scale, it''s a top notch photo with add-ons (10) Good luck with a really great picture', '2002-07-30 11:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97192, 3906, 1019, '<td valign="top">Good soaring buildings</td>', 'Good soaring buildings', '2002-07-30 15:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
