(97196, 3906, 1944, '<td valign="top">I like your cityscape shot very much.</td>', 'I like your cityscape shot very much.', '2002-08-01 00:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97197, 3906, 2997, '<td valign="top">I rate this picture highly for several reasons.  The theme was Corporate World.  You captured both words.  Had you shot only one bldg, the message would not have been conveyed as well.<br/>Next, the angle of the shot beatifully captures lines and angles.  The two bldgs in the foreground almost appear to be leaning toward each other.</td>', 'I rate this picture highly for several reasons.  The theme was Corporate World.  You captured both words.  Had you shot only one bldg, the message would not have been conveyed as well.Next, the angle of the shot beatifully captures lines and angles.  The two bldgs in the foreground almost appear to be leaning toward each other.', '2002-08-01 17:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97198, 3906, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice building shot.  Seems like it needs something, like a point of special interest or I don''t know, more....gotcha!  A decent example would be a similar shot in this challenge, with the title "Shining Star VP on 42nd Floor".  (it got a 7, too.)<br/>7 Swash</td>', 'Nice building shot.  Seems like it needs something, like a point of special interest or I don''t know, more....gotcha!  A decent example would be a similar shot in this challenge, with the title "Shining Star VP on 42nd Floor".  (it got a 7, too.)7 Swash', '2002-08-02 17:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97199, 3906, 2932, '<td valign="top">very interesting visually!  Although the tru vertical seems to be centered, the differing heights of the buildings give the illusion that you used the rule of thirds.</td>', 'very interesting visually!  Although the tru vertical seems to be centered, the differing heights of the buildings give the illusion that you used the rule of thirds.', '2002-08-03 02:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97200, 3907, 1154, '<td valign="top">good dipiction of todays economy</td>', 'good dipiction of todays economy', '2002-07-29 01:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97201, 3907, 1330, '<td valign="top">good depth</td>', 'good depth', '2002-07-29 02:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97202, 3907, 1792, '<td valign="top">Good composition.  Simple lines are appealing.</td>', 'Good composition.  Simple lines are appealing.', '2002-07-29 02:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97203, 3907, 2586, '<td valign="top">I like this image. Like the diagonal lines created by the vanishing perspective. However, I find the gate and the platform in the foreground distracting. The image would have been so much stronger without them. Good job though!</td>', 'I like this image. Like the diagonal lines created by the vanishing perspective. However, I find the gate and the platform in the foreground distracting. The image would have been so much stronger without them. Good job though!', '2002-07-29 03:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97204, 3907, 2261, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, the angle is spot on.</td>', 'Nice shot, the angle is spot on.', '2002-07-29 14:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97205, 3907, 2000, '<td valign="top">Creative take on the challenge.</td>', 'Creative take on the challenge.', '2002-07-29 14:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97206, 3907, 2553, '<td valign="top">Love the composition and the general look of this shot. lhall</td>', 'Love the composition and the general look of this shot. lhall', '2002-07-29 14:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97207, 3907, 2923, '<td valign="top">black and white with darkish feeling would work better...</td>', 'black and white with darkish feeling would work better...', '2002-07-29 16:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97208, 3907, 2752, '<td valign="top">great design and sharpness</td>', 'great design and sharpness', '2002-07-29 18:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97209, 3907, 2798, '<td valign="top">The foreground handrail is distracting and there needs to be more of a feeling of ''emptiness'' about the picture to really get the atmosphere across. Good concept though.</td>', 'The foreground handrail is distracting and there needs to be more of a feeling of ''emptiness'' about the picture to really get the atmosphere across. Good concept though.', '2002-07-30 09:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97210, 3907, 1169, '<td valign="top">i don''t ge it</td>', 'i don''t ge it', '2002-07-31 04:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97211, 3907, 2815, '<td valign="top">looks empty</td>', 'looks empty', '2002-07-31 11:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97212, 3907, 2983, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective</td>', 'Interesting perspective', '2002-07-31 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97213, 3907, 280, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, strong leading lines, I dont like the railings in the foreground may have been beter if you had taken this photo from closer to the railings so they are out os shot.</td>', 'Nice photo, strong leading lines, I dont like the railings in the foreground may have been beter if you had taken this photo from closer to the railings so they are out os shot.', '2002-08-01 16:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97214, 3907, 975, '<td valign="top">Shoulda been more over here and up there!</td>', 'Shoulda been more over here and up there!', '2002-08-03 14:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97215, 3907, 737, '<td valign="top">Composition - good<br/>Technical Aspects - good<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - ok<br/></td>', 'Composition - goodTechnical Aspects - goodMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality - ok', '2002-08-04 23:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97216, 3908, 1792, '<td valign="top">Good composition.  Simple subject matter.  Simple message.</td>', 'Good composition.  Simple subject matter.  Simple message.', '2002-07-29 03:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97217, 3908, 2000, '<td valign="top">I''d crop the top and left sides some - too much white space.</td>', 'I''d crop the top and left sides some - too much white space.', '2002-07-29 14:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97218, 3908, 2586, '<td valign="top">Meets challenge entirely  but not very original. Sky is very flat.</td>', 'Meets challenge entirely  but not very original. Sky is very flat.', '2002-07-29 16:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97219, 3908, 2752, '<td valign="top">great perspective</td>', 'great perspective', '2002-07-29 18:38:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(97220, 3908, 1796, '<td valign="top">looks too bright to me and might have more impact if it was more tightly cropped, especially on the left.</td>', 'looks too bright to me and might have more impact if it was more tightly cropped, especially on the left.', '2002-07-29 23:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97221, 3908, 1944, '<td valign="top">Very nice architectural shot. One of my favorite entries this week.</td>', 'Very nice architectural shot. One of my favorite entries this week.', '2002-07-29 23:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97222, 3908, 2278, '<td valign="top">I would like to see a tighter shot on this subject.  There seems to be too much sky which is very washed out and distracting.  Also, I think a tighter shot would help make this building seem more dominating and imposing, thereby helping get the point across better.</td>', 'I would like to see a tighter shot on this subject.  There seems to be too much sky which is very washed out and distracting.  Also, I think a tighter shot would help make this building seem more dominating and imposing, thereby helping get the point across better.', '2002-07-30 00:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97223, 3908, 3014, '<td valign="top">Yep, definitely a headquarters. The sad thing is that even though I don''t think I''ve seen this particular building, I''ve seen so many others like it that they all start to look the same. I''m sure the architect told the company they''d really stand out... Yeah, right.</td>', 'Yep, definitely a headquarters. The sad thing is that even though I don''t think I''ve seen this particular building, I''ve seen so many others like it that they all start to look the same. I''m sure the architect told the company they''d really stand out... Yeah, right.', '2002-07-30 23:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97224, 3908, 2858, '<td valign="top">I think getting rid of the sky/trees would give a nice abstract shot. It''s got good angles.</td>', 'I think getting rid of the sky/trees would give a nice abstract shot. It''s got good angles.', '2002-07-31 09:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97225, 3908, 748, '<td valign="top">Use of a polarizing filter may have helped the sky on this one.</td>', 'Use of a polarizing filter may have helped the sky on this one.', '2002-08-02 07:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97226, 3908, 737, '<td valign="top">Composition - good<br/>Technical Aspects - good<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - ok<br/></td>', 'Composition - goodTechnical Aspects - goodMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality - ok', '2002-08-04 23:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97227, 3909, 2752, '<td valign="top">good use of color to set the mood</td>', 'good use of color to set the mood', '2002-07-29 12:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97228, 3909, 2000, '<td valign="top">Good article choices, and meets the challenge quite well.</td>', 'Good article choices, and meets the challenge quite well.', '2002-07-29 14:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97229, 3909, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the overall look, but the photo does not inspire me. lhall</td>', 'I like the overall look, but the photo does not inspire me. lhall', '2002-07-29 15:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97230, 3909, 210, '<td valign="top">Negatives never looked so good.  I love this!  8.</td>', 'Negatives never looked so good.  I love this!  8.', '2002-07-29 15:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97231, 3909, 2586, '<td valign="top">Nice image I like the DOF. That white area near the top left though invites the eye''s attention. You probably didn''t intend that but had no control over it either.</td>', 'Nice image I like the DOF. That white area near the top left though invites the eye''s attention. You probably didn''t intend that but had no control over it either.', '2002-07-29 16:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97232, 3909, 1856, '<td valign="top">Splendid use of inverted colors!  I like it...the highlighting adds interest as well.  I would have liked it cropped down from the tad a bit.  8 Lisa</td>', 'Splendid use of inverted colors!  I like it...the highlighting adds interest as well.  I would have liked it cropped down from the tad a bit.  8 Lisa', '2002-07-29 16:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97233, 3909, 2798, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of negative. I like that - unusual and atmospheric. But for a really "black, depressing" look I think you needed softer lines and some shadows. Of course they would have had to be lights when you composed the scene. Great concept though - very original.</td>', 'Interesting use of negative. I like that - unusual and atmospheric. But for a really "black, depressing" look I think you needed softer lines and some shadows. Of course they would have had to be lights when you composed the scene. Great concept though - very original.', '2002-07-30 09:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97234, 3909, 2278, '<td valign="top">Normally I don''t care for inverted photos, but I think it adds to the gloom for you.  The picture seems kinda flat to me though (rather 2 dimensional).</td>', 'Normally I don''t care for inverted photos, but I think it adds to the gloom for you.  The picture seems kinda flat to me though (rather 2 dimensional).', '2002-07-30 21:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97235, 3909, 2109, '<td valign="top">I want to know how you did this!!  Well done -10 based on technnical merit</td>', 'I want to know how you did this!!  Well done -10 based on technnical merit', '2002-07-30 22:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97236, 3909, 3014, '<td valign="top">Can you say "Ouch!"? I like the way the inverted color gives the whole picture a dark and evil feel.</td>', 'Can you say "Ouch!"? I like the way the inverted color gives the whole picture a dark and evil feel.', '2002-07-30 23:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97237, 3909, 133, '<td valign="top">Startling color and contrasting.  Nice.</td>', 'Startling color and contrasting.  Nice.', '2002-07-31 08:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97238, 3909, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting color scheme.  Nicely focused shot, but a bit dry.  6 Swash</td>', 'Interesting color scheme.  Nicely focused shot, but a bit dry.  6 Swash', '2002-07-31 14:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97239, 3909, 835, '<td valign="top">I really like the editing that you did to this picture and the general layout of the papers.  Everything stands out well.  Great job</td>', 'I really like the editing that you did to this picture and the general layout of the papers.  Everything stands out well.  Great job', '2002-08-01 15:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97240, 3909, 280, '<td valign="top">The negative works well on the newspaper print , however I think a slight levels adjustment to improve the contrast a little may have helped.</td>', 'The negative works well on the newspaper print , however I think a slight levels adjustment to improve the contrast a little may have helped.', '2002-08-01 17:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97241, 3909, 875, '<td valign="top">I think this is one of the few good uses of inverse I have seen at DPC.  I love the want ads trailing off into the distance...</td>', 'I think this is one of the few good uses of inverse I have seen at DPC.  I love the want ads trailing off into the distance...', '2002-08-01 18:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97242, 3909, 472, '<td valign="top">killer inversion</td>', 'killer inversion', '2002-08-01 23:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97243, 3909, 2370, '<td valign="top">excellent use of inversion!</td>', 'excellent use of inversion!', '2002-08-02 02:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97244, 3909, 509, '<td valign="top">Good use of contrasts and colors, the highlites really add to it.  I like it a lot better inverted as you have done.</td>', 'Good use of contrasts and colors, the highlites really add to it.  I like it a lot better inverted as you have done.', '2002-08-04 19:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97245, 3909, 737, '<td valign="top">Composition - good<br/>Technical Aspects - quite good<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - quite good<br/></td>', 'Composition - goodTechnical Aspects - quite goodMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality - quite good', '2002-08-04 23:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97246, 3910, 2907, '<td valign="top">Why does this look so distorted... have you kept the aspect ratio the same from the camera??</td>', 'Why does this look so distorted... have you kept the aspect ratio the same from the camera??', '2002-07-29 03:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97247, 3910, 2586, '<td valign="top">Funny, I was considering a similar shot :) Love what the water is doing. You could have cleaned up the surroundings somewhat and remove the objects that are distracting. And to make sure that the image and title really pertain to the CW challenge, put a copy of the Wall Street Journal or something like that on the rim. Good job.</td>', 'Funny, I was considering a similar shot :) Love what the water is doing. You could have cleaned up the surroundings somewhat and remove the objects that are distracting. And to make sure that the image and title really pertain to the CW challenge, put a copy of the Wall Street Journal or something like that on the rim. Good job.', '2002-07-29 04:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97248, 3910, 2798, '<td valign="top">Either you have a very odd shaped toilet or this picture is stretched. Either way it''s distracting from the point of the picture. It''s a fine idea and you''ve captured the water well.</td>', 'Either you have a very odd shaped toilet or this picture is stretched. Either way it''s distracting from the point of the picture. It''s a fine idea and you''ve captured the water well.', '2002-07-29 09:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97249, 3910, 2923, '<td valign="top">Too cliche</td>', 'Too cliche', '2002-07-29 13:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97250, 3910, 2223, '<td valign="top">enough with the toilets!!!</td>', 'enough with the toilets!!!', '2002-07-29 13:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97251, 3910, 210, '<td valign="top">Cliche''d, uncreative and unfortunately distorted.</td>', 'Cliche''d, uncreative and unfortunately distorted.', '2002-07-29 15:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97252, 3910, 2764, '<td valign="top">Good idea, not a good photo,  Stuff on the floor is distracting and cluttered looking. distortion of toilet bowl shape is unpleasant to look at.  Hinges on the lid are not evenly cropped.  Could use somebetter editing</td>', 'Good idea, not a good photo,  Stuff on the floor is distracting and cluttered looking. distortion of toilet bowl shape is unpleasant to look at.  Hinges on the lid are not evenly cropped.  Could use somebetter editing', '2002-07-29 18:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97253, 3910, 1005, '<td valign="top">Is it me, or does this seem distorted?  (too round)  Flash flare on the lower edge of toilet, not good, try different angle, might go away.  I see the loose connection to this challenge, maybe a little tooo sublte.  Title helps, but maybe hit me over the head with "Investments", or "Retirement Fund".  4 Swash</td>', 'Is it me, or does this seem distorted?  (too round)  Flash flare on the lower edge of toilet, not good, try different angle, might go away.  I see the loose connection to this challenge, maybe a little tooo sublte.  Title helps, but maybe hit me over the head with "Investments", or "Retirement Fund".  4 Swash', '2002-07-29 18:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97254, 3910, 2668, '<td valign="top">great minds think alike....;)</td>', 'great minds think alike....;)', '2002-07-29 19:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97255, 3910, 811, '<td valign="top">It looks distorted and the stuff in the background is distracting.  Maybe a different angle.  Or if it showed some fake money or something being flushed it would be more interesting.  karmat</td>', 'It looks distorted and the stuff in the background is distracting.  Maybe a different angle.  Or if it showed some fake money or something being flushed it would be more interesting.  karmat', '2002-07-31 15:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97256, 3910, 2251, '<td valign="top">not bad, I knew a guy that did something like this in one of my screenprinting class but it was called enron''s bathtub and the workers 401k going down the drain. To learn more about the detramental effects of capitalism and statism, go to www.infoshop.org<br/>-Ben</td>', 'not bad, I knew a guy that did something like this in one of my screenprinting class but it was called enron''s bathtub and the workers 401k going down the drain. To learn more about the detramental effects of capitalism and statism, go to www.infoshop.org-Ben', '2002-07-31 19:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97257, 3910, 2361, '<td valign="top">An uninspired picture of a cliched image.</td>', 'An uninspired picture of a cliched image.', '2002-07-31 19:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97258, 3910, 1581, '<td valign="top">this sucks!!</td>', 'this sucks!!', '2002-07-31 20:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97259, 3910, 1882, '<td valign="top">It''s an OK idea, but the photo itself really sucks technically.  Nothing special about it in the least.</td>', 'It''s an OK idea, but the photo itself really sucks technically.  Nothing special about it in the least.', '2002-08-02 09:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97260, 3910, 806, '<td valign="top">Good stopped motion. Yes, it appears to be going down - however, what is going down? Could be anything, including what should be.</td>', 'Good stopped motion. Yes, it appears to be going down - however, what is going down? Could be anything, including what should be.', '2002-08-04 00:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97261, 3910, 3087, '<td valign="top">The idea is interesting but the shot isn''t quite as interesting. I find the bits and pieces of toilet brush, carpets and that little gold thing a little distracting. It looks a little stretched too?</td>', 'The idea is interesting but the shot isn''t quite as interesting. I find the bits and pieces of toilet brush, carpets and that little gold thing a little distracting. It looks a little stretched too?', '2002-08-04 18:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97262, 3910, 737, '<td valign="top">Composition - ok, I lost what is being flushed.<br/>Technical Aspects - good<br/>Meets Challenge - only with title<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - ok<br/></td>', 'Composition - ok, I lost what is being flushed.Technical Aspects - goodMeets Challenge - only with titleVisual Impact / Originality - ok', '2002-08-04 23:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97263, 3911, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting concept... i think the lighting is a little harsh on the bottom of the image... - jmsetzler</td>', 'interesting concept... i think the lighting is a little harsh on the bottom of the image... - jmsetzler', '2002-07-29 01:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97264, 3911, 2311, '<td valign="top">goodlight...the dead is the dead...</td>', 'goodlight...the dead is the dead...', '2002-07-29 03:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97265, 3911, 2700, '<td valign="top">not bad at all, I like the effect... 8</td>', 'not bad at all, I like the effect... 8', '2002-07-29 03:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97266, 3911, 801, '<td valign="top">...around the hell (usually). Good idea but... there is a big reflection you could have avoided.</td>', '...around the hell (usually). Good idea but... there is a big reflection you could have avoided.', '2002-07-29 06:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97267, 3911, 1983, '<td valign="top">I like this... I like that it isn''t just a shot of money like so many others...I like the graph overlay. Great job...10</td>', 'I like this... I like that it isn''t just a shot of money like so many others...I like the graph overlay. Great job...10', '2002-07-29 14:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97268, 3911, 2752, '<td valign="top">very cleverly done</td>', 'very cleverly done', '2002-07-29 16:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97269, 3911, 441, '<td valign="top">like the diving graph reflection.</td>', 'like the diving graph reflection.', '2002-07-29 18:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97270, 3911, 1005, '<td valign="top">This seems like a wonderful concept.  I want to think the transparency graph makes some sort of sense, but I don''t see it.  (It''s the blue/red lines that don''t seem to correlate to the green line.)  I don''t lke how this is lit.  The bottom is too bright and the top is too dark, with a whole lot of interesting viewables hidden by that lighting.  The graph is a cool idea, but I don''t like the "hand drawn" look to it.  (Kinda resembles Arabic, to me)  I started this out as a 6, wanted to take you up to 7, but talked myself out of it.  6 Swash</td>', 'This seems like a wonderful concept.  I want to think the transparency graph makes some sort of sense, but I don''t see it.  (It''s the blue/red lines that don''t seem to correlate to the green line.)  I don''t lke how this is lit.  The bottom is too bright and the top is too dark, with a whole lot of interesting viewables hidden by that lighting.  The graph is a cool idea, but I don''t like the "hand drawn" look to it.  (Kinda resembles Arabic, to me)  I started this out as a 6, wanted to take you up to 7, but talked myself out of it.  6 Swash', '2002-07-29 20:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97271, 3911, 2352, '<td valign="top">clever idea for a tough challenge!  Light direction could improve.  The glare is a distraction from what could have been a terrific shot.  Nice!</td>', 'clever idea for a tough challenge!  Light direction could improve.  The glare is a distraction from what could have been a terrific shot.  Nice!', '2002-07-29 22:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97272, 3911, 2829, '<td valign="top">I like the way you have used a glass to draw a graph. However, you did such a nice job with the green graph the blue streaks take a lot away from the photo. Good concept on money. Instead of the graph, using a blue globe would have definitely fit the title much better.</td>', 'I like the way you have used a glass to draw a graph. However, you did such a nice job with the green graph the blue streaks take a lot away from the photo. Good concept on money. Instead of the graph, using a blue globe would have definitely fit the title much better.', '2002-07-29 23:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97273, 3911, 1856, '<td valign="top">ohhh... is that a transparency lying over the money?  I couldn''t tell what it was.  Pretty cool effect.  6 Lisa</td>', 'ohhh... is that a transparency lying over the money?  I couldn''t tell what it was.  Pretty cool effect.  6 Lisa', '2002-07-29 23:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97274, 3911, 2337, '<td valign="top">At first the light at the bottom bothered me, but I got over it... This is a 10</td>', 'At first the light at the bottom bothered me, but I got over it... This is a 10', '2002-07-30 00:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97275, 3911, 2278, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea of this photo.  The glare in the bottom center is distracting from the blue bar graphs(?).</td>', 'I really like the idea of this photo.  The glare in the bottom center is distracting from the blue bar graphs(?).', '2002-07-30 01:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97276, 3911, 2928, '<td valign="top">Ah, a picture with a positive political overtone; I like this (how did you achieve the reflection?)  My only criticism would be to say that it''s a bit busy, too many objects for my liking.  But, I like the Queen''s eyes</td>', 'Ah, a picture with a positive political overtone; I like this (how did you achieve the reflection?)  My only criticism would be to say that it''s a bit busy, too many objects for my liking.  But, I like the Queen''s eyes', '2002-07-30 08:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97277, 3911, 2798, '<td valign="top">A fine concept but the blue hand drawn lines look like jets of gas. Not immediately understandable enough.</td>', 'A fine concept but the blue hand drawn lines look like jets of gas. Not immediately understandable enough.', '2002-07-30 08:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97278, 3911, 737, '<td valign="top">Composition - good<br/>Technical Aspects - ok. The overlay bothers me a little<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality -good<br/></td>', 'Composition - goodTechnical Aspects - ok. The overlay bothers me a littleMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality -good', '2002-07-31 00:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97279, 3911, 1169, '<td valign="top">amazing, how did u do it?</td>', 'amazing, how did u do it?', '2002-07-31 04:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97280, 3911, 1280, '<td valign="top">I''ll have to look at this some more before I decide.  I''ll try to get back with more comments.</td>', 'I''ll have to look at this some more before I decide.  I''ll try to get back with more comments.', '2002-07-31 17:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
