(97294, 3912, 2553, '<td valign="top">As for the challenge, Yup - on target.  I like the composition, but would have preferred to see it cropped down just below the lid, crop out the person on the right, and crop in just a little tighter to the couple on the left, cropping out a lot of the chair or whatever it is.  lhall</td>', 'As for the challenge, Yup - on target.  I like the composition, but would have preferred to see it cropped down just below the lid, crop out the person on the right, and crop in just a little tighter to the couple on the left, cropping out a lot of the chair or whatever it is.  lhall', '2002-07-29 14:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97295, 3912, 1944, '<td valign="top">Since I''m voting on your photo at a Starbucks using their wireless network while sipping on an iced moca, I gotta give you at least a little extra for the precognition:) It''s a nice entry anyway.</td>', 'Since I''m voting on your photo at a Starbucks using their wireless network while sipping on an iced moca, I gotta give you at least a little extra for the precognition:) It''s a nice entry anyway.', '2002-07-29 15:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
