(97303, 3912, 3014, '<td valign="top">They''re everywhere, they''re everywhere! Beautiful ambient lighting and in-your-face focus in this shot. But is this a condemnation of Starbuck''s?</td>', 'They''re everywhere, they''re everywhere! Beautiful ambient lighting and in-your-face focus in this shot. But is this a condemnation of Starbuck''s?', '2002-07-30 23:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97304, 3912, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting picture.  I really like it from a technical standpoint, and I don''t think I can take anything away there.  I really like the use of DOF; great idea.  The Corporate image is a little tenuous, but it would have been spot on (in my opinion) had the people in the background been wearing suits.  Costs points  but not many (8)</td>', 'This is an interesting picture.  I really like it from a technical standpoint, and I don''t think I can take anything away there.  I really like the use of DOF; great idea.  The Corporate image is a little tenuous, but it would have been spot on (in my opinion) had the people in the background been wearing suits.  Costs points  but not many (8)', '2002-07-31 10:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97305, 3912, 472, '<td valign="top">good pic. may not have relevance to people outside the US though<br/></td>', 'good pic. may not have relevance to people outside the US though', '2002-07-31 11:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97306, 3912, 121, '<td valign="top">This is the best picture of a Starbucks coffee cup I have seen today.  That can''t be coffee in there can it? it looks foul.  I know there''s not much to play with here but it looks a little dull and lifeless, no striking colours or anything to make it other than a snap of a plastic cup. The image is a little dark on the right side.</td>', 'This is the best picture of a Starbucks coffee cup I have seen today.  That can''t be coffee in there can it? it looks foul.  I know there''s not much to play with here but it looks a little dull and lifeless, no striking colours or anything to make it other than a snap of a plastic cup. The image is a little dark on the right side.', '2002-07-31 16:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97307, 3912, 138, '<td valign="top">the devil!</td>', 'the devil!', '2002-08-01 12:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97308, 3912, 2337, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but would have NAILED the challenge if the folks in the background were in suits/ties (yes, I know, you can''t walk up to folks in a Starbucks and tell them "HEY! We have a dress code here!! Put on this jacket!)...Shallow dof works real well here...</td>', 'Nice composition, but would have NAILED the challenge if the folks in the background were in suits/ties (yes, I know, you can''t walk up to folks in a Starbucks and tell them "HEY! We have a dress code here!! Put on this jacket!)...Shallow dof works real well here...', '2002-08-01 20:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97309, 3912, 1005, '<td valign="top">Big corporation, good enough pic, estimated effort (rather not say....).  The shot itself is pretty good, but the background is difficult.  (joke:  were you hanging out with Tom Walthrop? see him comments after the challenge, I am being nice to you!)  Suggestions:  take your cup up to the counter, use a menu as a back drop (or anything else interesting up there) ; or take the pic of the iced latte being made; or you enjoying it.  (tried the 1/3rd rule?  it helped)  7 Swash</td>', 'Big corporation, good enough pic, estimated effort (rather not say....).  The shot itself is pretty good, but the background is difficult.  (joke:  were you hanging out with Tom Walthrop? see him comments after the challenge, I am being nice to you!)  Suggestions:  take your cup up to the counter, use a menu as a back drop (or anything else interesting up there) ; or take the pic of the iced latte being made; or you enjoying it.  (tried the 1/3rd rule?  it helped)  7 Swash', '2002-08-01 20:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
