(97363, 3916, 1944, '<td valign="top">would have been better if the ticker sign had an average on it.</td>', 'would have been better if the ticker sign had an average on it.', '2002-07-29 15:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97364, 3916, 2923, '<td valign="top">I like this, imaginative but could use some more lighting/contrast</td>', 'I like this, imaginative but could use some more lighting/contrast', '2002-07-29 15:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97365, 3916, 117, '<td valign="top">i like the reflextion this was a tough subject</td>', 'i like the reflextion this was a tough subject', '2002-07-29 19:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97366, 3916, 2798, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Good colour but bad light.</td>', 'Nice idea. Good colour but bad light.', '2002-07-30 09:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97367, 3916, 2350, '<td valign="top">Your right on the money with this great reflection.</td>', 'Your right on the money with this great reflection.', '2002-07-30 11:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97368, 3916, 917, '<td valign="top">Not a comment directed at you in particular, but the weak puns are starting to grate, oh well on to the next, no doubt it''ll be money going down a plughole, or something about bulls.<br/><br/>Oh, and the picture looks a bit ''squinty''. Maybe a polaroid filter would get rid if the brightness, and help penetrate the NASDAQ sign. Maybe a vertical frame and stepping to the left a bit would help isolate the active elements in the picture (The sign and the relected church) from the other bits, like the the traffic and the other buildings.</td>', 'Not a comment directed at you in particular, but the weak puns are starting to grate, oh well on to the next, no doubt it''ll be money going down a plughole, or something about bulls.Oh, and the picture looks a bit ''squinty''. Maybe a polaroid filter would get rid if the brightness, and help penetrate the NASDAQ sign. Maybe a vertical frame and stepping to the left a bit would help isolate the active elements in the picture (The sign and the relected church) from the other bits, like the the traffic and the other buildings.', '2002-07-30 12:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97369, 3916, 2481, '<td valign="top">could be an interesting interpretation - have we  been replacing our faith with money?  Nice reflection</td>', 'could be an interesting interpretation - have we  been replacing our faith with money?  Nice reflection', '2002-07-30 18:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97370, 3916, 1024, '<td valign="top">I  so much like "found" shots over "setup" ones.  Your colors are bright, the reflection is very clear.  The only thing I might have done differently (if at all possible) would be to wiat for the traffic to clear before taking the photo.  I do realize that sometimes that is not possible so I am not marking you down for it.  9  BAMartin</td>', 'I  so much like "found" shots over "setup" ones.  Your colors are bright, the reflection is very clear.  The only thing I might have done differently (if at all possible) would be to wiat for the traffic to clear before taking the photo.  I do realize that sometimes that is not possible so I am not marking you down for it.  9  BAMartin', '2002-07-30 18:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97371, 3916, 210, '<td valign="top">I love this idea.  Although the aesthetics aren''t top-notch, I love the message.  7.</td>', 'I love this idea.  Although the aesthetics aren''t top-notch, I love the message.  7.', '2002-07-30 18:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97372, 3916, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool reflection shot.  I tried a lazy crop, I like this better as a portrait shot of just the right half.  The brick, NASDAQ sign and other building just add to the distractions.   USBancorp and the church would have been good enough.  Too bad you couldn''t go into the business and close their blinds.   Finally, your title, are you trying to say that in order to be successful in the corporate world, you have to lose your faith?  8 Swash (looks like the Puget Sound, is this Tacoma?)</td>', 'This is a really cool reflection shot.  I tried a lazy crop, I like this better as a portrait shot of just the right half.  The brick, NASDAQ sign and other building just add to the distractions.   USBancorp and the church would have been good enough.  Too bad you couldn''t go into the business and close their blinds.   Finally, your title, are you trying to say that in order to be successful in the corporate world, you have to lose your faith?  8 Swash (looks like the Puget Sound, is this Tacoma?)', '2002-07-30 20:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97373, 3916, 3014, '<td valign="top">Good photo, good title.</td>', 'Good photo, good title.', '2002-07-31 03:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97374, 3916, 2146, '<td valign="top">awsome reflection</td>', 'awsome reflection', '2002-07-31 07:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97375, 3916, 133, '<td valign="top">You have a great eye to see this photograph.  Nicely Done.</td>', 'You have a great eye to see this photograph.  Nicely Done.', '2002-07-31 08:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97376, 3916, 1467, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection and angles.</td>', 'Nice reflection and angles.', '2002-07-31 23:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97377, 3916, 2472, '<td valign="top">Perfect picture for the title and the challenge.</td>', 'Perfect picture for the title and the challenge.', '2002-08-02 22:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97378, 3916, 637, '<td valign="top">Clever; nice colors 6 sjgleah</td>', 'Clever; nice colors 6 sjgleah', '2002-08-02 23:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97379, 3916, 811, '<td valign="top">Excellent job of getting the reflection in focus.  This is a great capture.  I think it needs to be cropped just a touch on the left, and if it had been possible to shoot at another time of the day, maybe the NASDAQ wouldn''t have a glare (of course, you probably wouldn''t have as good a reflection, either.)  karmat</td>', 'Excellent job of getting the reflection in focus.  This is a great capture.  I think it needs to be cropped just a touch on the left, and if it had been possible to shoot at another time of the day, maybe the NASDAQ wouldn''t have a glare (of course, you probably wouldn''t have as good a reflection, either.)  karmat', '2002-08-03 00:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97380, 3916, 2247, '<td valign="top">Nice.  The church in the reflection connects with the background and your title.  Good composition</td>', 'Nice.  The church in the reflection connects with the background and your title.  Good composition', '2002-08-04 23:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97381, 3916, 737, '<td valign="top">Composition - quite good<br/>Technical Aspects - quite good. Good use of reflection.<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - good<br/></td>', 'Composition - quite goodTechnical Aspects - quite good. Good use of reflection.Meets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality - good', '2002-08-04 23:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97382, 3917, 2907, '<td valign="top">Interestting improvisation of glass cup for a lens filter... good result.</td>', 'Interestting improvisation of glass cup for a lens filter... good result.', '2002-07-29 04:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97383, 3917, 210, '<td valign="top">The first image this week to utterly confuse me.</td>', 'The first image this week to utterly confuse me.', '2002-07-29 15:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97384, 3917, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is a very good picture up against some stiff competition...</td>', 'This is a very good picture up against some stiff competition...', '2002-07-29 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97385, 3917, 2752, '<td valign="top">great design and sharpness</td>', 'great design and sharpness', '2002-07-29 18:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97386, 3917, 1005, '<td valign="top">Is this supposed to refer to Corporate sponsorship of athletics?  This is a great shot, please don''t think I hate it.  As with so many entries this week, it has a loose connection to the challenge, but acceptable.  I certainly hope you didn''t ruin your camera for this shot!  It''s very cool!  Nice water effects.  8 Swash</td>', 'Is this supposed to refer to Corporate sponsorship of athletics?  This is a great shot, please don''t think I hate it.  As with so many entries this week, it has a loose connection to the challenge, but acceptable.  I certainly hope you didn''t ruin your camera for this shot!  It''s very cool!  Nice water effects.  8 Swash', '2002-07-30 20:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97387, 3917, 2109, '<td valign="top">Oooh.. nice effect.  I''d love to see how this was done -9</td>', 'Oooh.. nice effect.  I''d love to see how this was done -9', '2002-07-30 22:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
