(97389, 3917, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the abstractness and the colors in this one.  I also think you have done well in keeping reflections to a minimum. karmat</td>', 'I like the abstractness and the colors in this one.  I also think you have done well in keeping reflections to a minimum. karmat', '2002-08-02 23:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97390, 3918, 92, '<td valign="top">This was one of my first ideas. This is the REAL story. What it''s done to economy. Nicely done. = 9 Shiiizzzam</td>', 'This was one of my first ideas. This is the REAL story. What it''s done to economy. Nicely done. = 9 Shiiizzzam', '2002-07-29 03:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97391, 3918, 2586, '<td valign="top">Nice, nice image. Great composition, great clarity. Love the diagonal line with that little bit of sky showing and the juxtaposition with the shape of the For Lease sign. Great job.</td>', 'Nice, nice image. Great composition, great clarity. Love the diagonal line with that little bit of sky showing and the juxtaposition with the shape of the For Lease sign. Great job.', '2002-07-29 04:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97392, 3918, 1042, '<td valign="top">I like the angles in this. I like what it says to me too. Nice job .. kdj 7</td>', 'I like the angles in this. I like what it says to me too. Nice job .. kdj 7', '2002-07-29 11:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97393, 3918, 2752, '<td valign="top">a great pictorial story of our times....very effective in greyscale</td>', 'a great pictorial story of our times....very effective in greyscale', '2002-07-29 11:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97394, 3918, 2553, '<td valign="top">Nails it!  Very nice. lhall</td>', 'Nails it!  Very nice. lhall', '2002-07-29 15:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97395, 3918, 1569, '<td valign="top">Good one--just needs a little contrast tweaking.</td>', 'Good one--just needs a little contrast tweaking.', '2002-07-29 21:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97396, 3918, 2352, '<td valign="top">Nice shot for the challenge!  Clean variety of lines...</td>', 'Nice shot for the challenge!  Clean variety of lines...', '2002-07-29 22:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97397, 3918, 2798, '<td valign="top">Nice architecture - improved by the B&amp;W. But I think the lease sign is a little too central. I think I''d also have played with the curves in photoshop a little  to make the light greys a little darker - give it more contrast.</td>', 'Nice architecture - improved by the B&W. But I think the lease sign is a little too central. I think I''d also have played with the curves in photoshop a little  to make the light greys a little darker - give it more contrast.', '2002-07-30 09:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97398, 3918, 2109, '<td valign="top">nice geometry in this</td>', 'nice geometry in this', '2002-07-30 22:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97399, 3918, 3014, '<td valign="top">You see a lot of these signs these days.</td>', 'You see a lot of these signs these days.', '2002-07-31 02:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97400, 3918, 2146, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2002-07-31 07:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97401, 3918, 637, '<td valign="top">Nice lines, nice use of b&amp;w  6 sjgleah</td>', 'Nice lines, nice use of b&w  6 sjgleah', '2002-08-01 07:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97402, 3918, 875, '<td valign="top">I love the angles in this shot - the roof line, the building, even the shadows.</td>', 'I love the angles in this shot - the roof line, the building, even the shadows.', '2002-08-01 23:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97403, 3918, 2932, '<td valign="top">nice absence of saturation -- mirrors the emptyness of the "For Lease" sign well</td>', 'nice absence of saturation -- mirrors the emptyness of the "For Lease" sign well', '2002-08-03 02:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97404, 3918, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like how you''ve used the lines in this composition.  Everything is so angular, and the shadows jsut emphasize and strengthen that.  The black and white also makes it powerful. karmat</td>', 'I really like how you''ve used the lines in this composition.  Everything is so angular, and the shadows jsut emphasize and strengthen that.  The black and white also makes it powerful. karmat', '2002-08-03 13:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97405, 3919, 1330, '<td valign="top">just a little overexposed but I like the idea</td>', 'just a little overexposed but I like the idea', '2002-07-29 01:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97406, 3919, 2553, '<td valign="top">Been there!   I love the b&amp;w,  the composition, and whatever you did to give it the "overexposed" feel (please forgive my lack of technical expertise). Also projects to me an "isolationist" feel which I think most people feel in regards to the "consumer" versus "national economics" dynamic. Love your concept. lhall</td>', 'Been there!   I love the b&w,  the composition, and whatever you did to give it the "overexposed" feel (please forgive my lack of technical expertise). Also projects to me an "isolationist" feel which I think most people feel in regards to the "consumer" versus "national economics" dynamic. Love your concept. lhall', '2002-07-29 07:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97407, 3919, 2798, '<td valign="top">Wow - love it. Excellent pose from your subject. Great use of whitespace and bold, confident use of your photoediting software. This week''s winner I hope.</td>', 'Wow - love it. Excellent pose from your subject. Great use of whitespace and bold, confident use of your photoediting software. This week''s winner I hope.', '2002-07-29 09:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97408, 3919, 1, '<td valign="top">Nicely overexposed to set the atmosphere.  The shot is great, it just doesn''t tie into the corporate world that well.</td>', 'Nicely overexposed to set the atmosphere.  The shot is great, it just doesn''t tie into the corporate world that well.', '2002-07-29 11:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97409, 3919, 2, '<td valign="top">This one''s really caught my eye.  I know it''s a pretty bold artistic statement to make on this site, but I think you''ve done it amazingly well.  Great job.  9</td>', 'This one''s really caught my eye.  I know it''s a pretty bold artistic statement to make on this site, but I think you''ve done it amazingly well.  Great job.  9', '2002-07-29 12:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97410, 3919, 2000, '<td valign="top">Looks extremely washed out.  While that may have been the goal, it doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'Looks extremely washed out.  While that may have been the goal, it doesn''t work for me.', '2002-07-29 13:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97411, 3919, 1856, '<td valign="top">I like this.  I think it might be blown out just a little too much though.  Original idea! 7 Lisa</td>', 'I like this.  I think it might be blown out just a little too much though.  Original idea! 7 Lisa', '2002-07-29 17:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97412, 3919, 2983, '<td valign="top">I think most would be tunred off by the excessive use of white, but it works for me.  The composition is good, the large white areas convey the emotion in the face very well.  Very artistic.</td>', 'I think most would be tunred off by the excessive use of white, but it works for me.  The composition is good, the large white areas convey the emotion in the face very well.  Very artistic.', '2002-07-29 17:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97413, 3919, 2928, '<td valign="top">This picture doesn''t need a caption... It jumps out, maybe some people wont like all that white, but it works for - great picture...</td>', 'This picture doesn''t need a caption... It jumps out, maybe some people wont like all that white, but it works for - great picture...', '2002-07-29 17:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97414, 3919, 2668, '<td valign="top">too bright, or cropping it down to just the subject might''ve taken away from the brightness.  The phone in her hand isn''t even noticable unless you really look at it.</td>', 'too bright, or cropping it down to just the subject might''ve taken away from the brightness.  The phone in her hand isn''t even noticable unless you really look at it.', '2002-07-29 18:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97415, 3919, 2352, '<td valign="top">The title helps to fit the challenge, but the pic is over exposed and almost blinding...</td>', 'The title helps to fit the challenge, but the pic is over exposed and almost blinding...', '2002-07-29 23:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97416, 3919, 2195, '<td valign="top">slightly too whit IMO but I love it</td>', 'slightly too whit IMO but I love it', '2002-07-29 23:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97417, 3919, 441, '<td valign="top">not sure if you got the effect or framing you desired here - too much white-out and naked space I suggest -5</td>', 'not sure if you got the effect or framing you desired here - too much white-out and naked space I suggest -5', '2002-07-30 09:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97418, 3919, 573, '<td valign="top">One of my top ten picks, sole on artistic merit.</td>', 'One of my top ten picks, sole on artistic merit.', '2002-07-30 13:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97419, 3919, 1024, '<td valign="top">Normally I am a fan of negative space,  but I do not fel that it works here.  Maybe the figure is too bright and seems to bleed into the brightness (although I am sure that is what you intended, it just does not work for me).</td>', 'Normally I am a fan of negative space,  but I do not fel that it works here.  Maybe the figure is too bright and seems to bleed into the brightness (although I am sure that is what you intended, it just does not work for me).', '2002-07-30 18:21:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(97420, 3919, 1175, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but its too blown out.  I''d like to see some more detail.  Also the white doesn''t really symbolize dissatisfaction to me.  I might have tinted this whole thing red or maybe left it in color and used high saturation.  Hmm... I wonder what that would have looked like.</td>', 'I like the idea but its too blown out.  I''d like to see some more detail.  Also the white doesn''t really symbolize dissatisfaction to me.  I might have tinted this whole thing red or maybe left it in color and used high saturation.  Hmm... I wonder what that would have looked like.', '2002-07-30 20:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97421, 3919, 737, '<td valign="top">Composition - good<br/>Technical Aspects - way blown out for me - even if trying to show a mood<br/>Meets Challenge - I can''t be sure<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - not much/ high<br/></td>', 'Composition - goodTechnical Aspects - way blown out for me - even if trying to show a moodMeets Challenge - I can''t be sureVisual Impact / Originality - not much/ high', '2002-07-31 01:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97422, 3919, 1169, '<td valign="top">nice use of the flash</td>', 'nice use of the flash', '2002-07-31 04:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97423, 3919, 2858, '<td valign="top">Unlike the person in the picture, this stands out a mile</td>', 'Unlike the person in the picture, this stands out a mile', '2002-07-31 07:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97424, 3919, 2146, '<td valign="top">to bright</td>', 'to bright', '2002-07-31 08:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97425, 3919, 133, '<td valign="top">A good idea, and the blown out highlights kind of work here. But yet I''d like to see less white.</td>', 'A good idea, and the blown out highlights kind of work here. But yet I''d like to see less white.', '2002-07-31 08:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97426, 3919, 2337, '<td valign="top">Great use of negative space!  I like the way the ''consumer'' blends with the background, kind of like we all do to businesses.  (Dang, I hope that''s how you meant it)... Currently a 9... will be on my list to consider for a 10</td>', 'Great use of negative space!  I like the way the ''consumer'' blends with the background, kind of like we all do to businesses.  (Dang, I hope that''s how you meant it)... Currently a 9... will be on my list to consider for a 10', '2002-07-31 14:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97427, 3919, 121, '<td valign="top">I can''t make up my mind with this one. There is just enough detail there to catch her expression and I think I like the high key look. I''m not sure of the composition, did you try it with the woman filling the frame, ie cropped along her left arm and tight over her head. I can''t decide which works best, yours is certainly the more unexpected look. Will have to come back to this.</td>', 'I can''t make up my mind with this one. There is just enough detail there to catch her expression and I think I like the high key look. I''m not sure of the composition, did you try it with the woman filling the frame, ie cropped along her left arm and tight over her head. I can''t decide which works best, yours is certainly the more unexpected look. Will have to come back to this.', '2002-07-31 17:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97428, 3919, 1581, '<td valign="top">this is freekin'' awsome.  i love the constrast.  i can''t say enough-it''s great.</td>', 'this is freekin'' awsome.  i love the constrast.  i can''t say enough-it''s great.', '2002-07-31 20:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97429, 3919, 255, '<td valign="top">best of the bunch! great composition, lighting and contrast--and great mood. Looks like she is depressed --why not about money?!! I''d hang this on my wall. 10--amitchell</td>', 'best of the bunch! great composition, lighting and contrast--and great mood. Looks like she is depressed --why not about money?!! I''d hang this on my wall. 10--amitchell', '2002-08-01 01:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97430, 3919, 637, '<td valign="top">Not sure what this stark image is really trying to say.  3 sjgleah</td>', 'Not sure what this stark image is really trying to say.  3 sjgleah', '2002-08-01 06:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97431, 3919, 2199, '<td valign="top">Great composition -- this is one of my favorite photographs of the week. Did you try from a slightly lower angle, with the subject filling just a bit more of the frame? I''m not sure I''d like that better -- just wonder how many variations you have of the photo. Excellent!  LanSnake</td>', 'Great composition -- this is one of my favorite photographs of the week. Did you try from a slightly lower angle, with the subject filling just a bit more of the frame? I''m not sure I''d like that better -- just wonder how many variations you have of the photo. Excellent!  LanSnake', '2002-08-01 13:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97432, 3919, 1882, '<td valign="top">oh please.  does NOT meet challenge.</td>', 'oh please.  does NOT meet challenge.', '2002-08-02 09:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97433, 3919, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the how this picture seems to project despair.  I like the high contrast and negative space on the right.  For my personal taste, I wish the subject was just a touch sharper. karmat</td>', 'I like the how this picture seems to project despair.  I like the high contrast and negative space on the right.  For my personal taste, I wish the subject was just a touch sharper. karmat', '2002-08-03 00:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97434, 3919, 2261, '<td valign="top">I loved this but would crop off some of the empty space.  Good shot.</td>', 'I loved this but would crop off some of the empty space.  Good shot.', '2002-08-03 12:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97435, 3919, 806, '<td valign="top">This is very clever. I wonder if you are getting too much criticizm for "contrast"! Hope not. This is one of my fav''s.</td>', 'This is very clever. I wonder if you are getting too much criticizm for "contrast"! Hope not. This is one of my fav''s.', '2002-08-04 00:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97436, 3919, 2221, '<td valign="top">I like this photo. I reall transports a mood. But I think the title does not fit. When I''m not satisfied with a product I would not look _that_ desperate ;-) Something like "jobless" or "paying the bills" would be better IMHO.<br/>Technically... I guess many will say it''s overexposured but it''s ok for me. It really creates a strong mood. Negative space also helps to stress the desperation.</td>', 'I like this photo. I reall transports a mood. But I think the title does not fit. When I''m not satisfied with a product I would not look _that_ desperate ;-) Something like "jobless" or "paying the bills" would be better IMHO.Technically... I guess many will say it''s overexposured but it''s ok for me. It really creates a strong mood. Negative space also helps to stress the desperation.', '2002-08-04 01:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97437, 3919, 2370, '<td valign="top">a nice high key shot</td>', 'a nice high key shot', '2002-08-04 13:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97438, 3919, 2798, '<td valign="top">You were robbed. This deserved to place MUCH higher than 50th. This was one of only two 10s for me this week and it was my favourite over all.</td>', 'You were robbed. This deserved to place MUCH higher than 50th. This was one of only two 10s for me this week and it was my favourite over all.', '2002-08-05 06:19:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(97439, 3919, 312, '<td valign="top">thanks to everyone for you kind words (and to those who didn''t have anything nice to say). this photo definitely got misunderstood, and that''s totally my fault. one of the things i don''t think many realized is that she has a phone in her hand. this photo stemmed from my recent frustrations with dealing with a big telecom company and getting absolutely nowhere every time i talked to someone new. the title ties that in. i think if i were to re-do this shot, i''d use a black phone so it didn''t get blown out with the rest of the photo. if i were going to reshoot this for myself and not for a challenge, i''d take out the phone completely.<br/><br/>oh, and just for the record - IT WAS OVEREXPOSED ON PURPOSE AND I GOT EXACTLY WHAT I INTENDED.<br/><br/>thanks :)</td>', 'thanks to everyone for you kind words (and to those who didn''t have anything nice to say). this photo definitely got misunderstood, and that''s totally my fault. one of the things i don''t think many realized is that she has a phone in her hand. this photo stemmed from my recent frustrations with dealing with a big telecom company and getting absolutely nowhere every time i talked to someone new. the title ties that in. i think if i were to re-do this shot, i''d use a black phone so it didn''t get blown out with the rest of the photo. if i were going to reshoot this for myself and not for a challenge, i''d take out the phone completely.oh, and just for the record - IT WAS OVEREXPOSED ON PURPOSE AND I GOT EXACTLY WHAT I INTENDED.thanks :)', '2002-08-05 19:27:00.000000', NULL, 0),
