(97445, 3920, 2928, '<td valign="top">Absolutely hate the title  but the picture is superb.  It is a great picture and it deserves to win the challenge  but, as you have already seen no doubt, it''s up against some pretty stiff opposition.  It fits every criteria, it has a great feel, and I think it should have been titled something like "The Boss Awaits!"   It is a truly well thought out and professionally executed image.  I will be disappointed on your behalf if this doesn''t win  but I''m just one voter (10++)  Good luck</td>', 'Absolutely hate the title  but the picture is superb.  It is a great picture and it deserves to win the challenge  but, as you have already seen no doubt, it''s up against some pretty stiff opposition.  It fits every criteria, it has a great feel, and I think it should have been titled something like "The Boss Awaits!"   It is a truly well thought out and professionally executed image.  I will be disappointed on your behalf if this doesn''t win  but I''m just one voter (10++)  Good luck', '2002-07-30 12:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97446, 3920, 2587, '<td valign="top">Great idea. The big shot is still around but everyone else has been layed off ... or at least that''s what I get out of it. I love the balanced composition and the red highlights. I would''ve liked to see this with a bit more contrast to enhance the photo and the concept.</td>', 'Great idea. The big shot is still around but everyone else has been layed off ... or at least that''s what I get out of it. I love the balanced composition and the red highlights. I would''ve liked to see this with a bit more contrast to enhance the photo and the concept.', '2002-07-30 17:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
