(97458, 3920, 811, '<td valign="top">Good symmetry.  the only suggestion i would make would be to make sure the monitors were showing the same thing.  Not sure what caused one to be bright and one dark, but it causes a noticeable glare on the left side of the picture.  Still, a great job. karmat</td>', 'Good symmetry.  the only suggestion i would make would be to make sure the monitors were showing the same thing.  Not sure what caused one to be bright and one dark, but it causes a noticeable glare on the left side of the picture.  Still, a great job. karmat', '2002-08-03 12:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97459, 3920, 2472, '<td valign="top">Thank you all very much for the nice comments. This site makes taking pictures a very enjoying experience.<br/><br/>Karmat: the left side monitor is a drawing surface that reflected the natual back light. The right one is a computer monitor, and at the center we have a back-proyection monitor.<br/><br/>The title perhaps was not the best choice. I just wanted to infer the empty board room of a corporation with the empty accounts. (fortunately we are not involved at all with the corporate disasters of lately, eventhough we are a telecomunications company, but since we are based in Mexico, the acconting rules here wouldn''t permit such errors and frauds.</td>', 'Thank you all very much for the nice comments. This site makes taking pictures a very enjoying experience.Karmat: the left side monitor is a drawing surface that reflected the natual back light. The right one is a computer monitor, and at the center we have a back-proyection monitor.The title perhaps was not the best choice. I just wanted to infer the empty board room of a corporation with the empty accounts. (fortunately we are not involved at all with the corporate disasters of lately, eventhough we are a telecomunications company, but since we are based in Mexico, the acconting rules here wouldn''t permit such errors and frauds.', '2002-08-10 02:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
