(97536, 3926, 2928, '<td valign="top">It''s a great picture, it''s powerful, sad and dramatic My only criticism is that the composition is not as central as it could be, too much background detracts from the central theme.  A small point, but (to me) a fairly big flaw on an otherwise flawless picture Perhaps a macro close up that allowed the subject to fill the frame would have been better</td>', 'It''s a great picture, it''s powerful, sad and dramatic My only criticism is that the composition is not as central as it could be, too much background detracts from the central theme.  A small point, but (to me) a fairly big flaw on an otherwise flawless picture Perhaps a macro close up that allowed the subject to fill the frame would have been better', '2002-07-31 06:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
