(97662, 3931, 1005, '<td valign="top">Funny shot!  (at $500, if he can file, I''ll buy him!  Wait, how much does he cost in room and board?  Will you negotiate down to say...$300?)  Well shot and composed.  This one grows on you.  Started out as a 7, but it''s your lucky day!  How about 8, instead?  Swash</td>', 'Funny shot!  (at $500, if he can file, I''ll buy him!  Wait, how much does he cost in room and board?  Will you negotiate down to say...$300?)  Well shot and composed.  This one grows on you.  Started out as a 7, but it''s your lucky day!  How about 8, instead?  Swash', '2002-08-01 20:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97663, 3931, 205, '<td valign="top">I like it, I sold myself into slavery for 6.50 an hour.</td>', 'I like it, I sold myself into slavery for 6.50 an hour.', '2002-08-01 23:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97664, 3931, 1882, '<td valign="top">hmmm.. where''s the adam''s apple?</td>', 'hmmm.. where''s the adam''s apple?', '2002-08-02 09:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97665, 3931, 472, '<td valign="top">what a skinny chap.  looks like his shirt is too big for him .. maybe''s too young for so much responsibility? they have labor laws!  God Save the Children!  (And the Queen).  Looks lik ehe needs to trim up his short hairs too.  And what a big huge tie knot.  This feller needs a mentor.  Someone to take him under their wing.  Otherwise he''s going to end up living in a hamster cage working for old lettuce.  As for the photo: needs a bounce on the camera right to fill in the shadows a hair.  I''d have put the neck sticker on the light side, too, and put a period after the last 9.  mag 99</td>', 'what a skinny chap.  looks like his shirt is too big for him .. maybe''s too young for so much responsibility? they have labor laws!  God Save the Children!  (And the Queen).  Looks lik ehe needs to trim up his short hairs too.  And what a big huge tie knot.  This feller needs a mentor.  Someone to take him under their wing.  Otherwise he''s going to end up living in a hamster cage working for old lettuce.  As for the photo: needs a bounce on the camera right to fill in the shadows a hair.  I''d have put the neck sticker on the light side, too, and put a period after the last 9.  mag 99', '2002-08-02 15:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
