(97678, 3932, 2000, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  I see no connection to anything corporate, but nice picture anyway.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  I see no connection to anything corporate, but nice picture anyway.', '2002-07-29 14:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97679, 3932, 2352, '<td valign="top">Nice pic but the title does not work for me.  Clean shot but no story to it...</td>', 'Nice pic but the title does not work for me.  Clean shot but no story to it...', '2002-07-29 22:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97680, 3932, 441, '<td valign="top">good cosept, great effect well caught</td>', 'good cosept, great effect well caught', '2002-07-30 08:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97681, 3932, 2798, '<td valign="top">OMG - who works like this? That desk is TIDY for heaven''s sake! Nice motion shot. Not sure what it has to do with the challenge and there is a slight brown/orange caste - is the white balace set right? But otherwise forcus is where it should be and the composition is good.</td>', 'OMG - who works like this? That desk is TIDY for heaven''s sake! Nice motion shot. Not sure what it has to do with the challenge and there is a slight brown/orange caste - is the white balace set right? But otherwise forcus is where it should be and the composition is good.', '2002-07-30 11:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97682, 3932, 2928, '<td valign="top">There is a fine line between a good and a bad picture.  I don''t know if I really like it or really don''t.  I keep coming back, but I fall into an undecided category.  I think that while the person in the picture is distressed, the office isn''t  it''s far too neat and there''s nothing seeming to indicate stress anywhere else in the picture  even on the computer screen.  Is this a subtle but deliberate ploy - or isn''t it.  Technically, I think it''s fine.  Subject matter and content, I''m not so sure.  Perhaps others will be a bit more definite.  As for me, because of the uncertainty I will score it in the middle Good luck</td>', 'There is a fine line between a good and a bad picture.  I don''t know if I really like it or really don''t.  I keep coming back, but I fall into an undecided category.  I think that while the person in the picture is distressed, the office isn''t  it''s far too neat and there''s nothing seeming to indicate stress anywhere else in the picture  even on the computer screen.  Is this a subtle but deliberate ploy - or isn''t it.  Technically, I think it''s fine.  Subject matter and content, I''m not so sure.  Perhaps others will be a bit more definite.  As for me, because of the uncertainty I will score it in the middle Good luck', '2002-07-30 12:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
