(97693, 3933, 2553, '<td valign="top">This is exactly what I had in mind when I thought of the challenge. I like repeating patterns,  and the overall "moody" feel.  I think I would have liked it better with the lights at the bottom cropped out - the lights give it a "lived in" feel, and I would have liked a little bit more of a "dark, desolate" feel. lhall</td>', 'This is exactly what I had in mind when I thought of the challenge. I like repeating patterns,  and the overall "moody" feel.  I think I would have liked it better with the lights at the bottom cropped out - the lights give it a "lived in" feel, and I would have liked a little bit more of a "dark, desolate" feel. lhall', '2002-07-29 06:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
