(97696, 3933, 1856, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting in this photo...very ominious feeling to it.  Possible improvements might include centering on the monkey wards sign, brightening a little to help out the contrast, and getting a perspective without the trees.  Very strong on topic...good job!  7 Lisa</td>', 'I like the lighting in this photo...very ominious feeling to it.  Possible improvements might include centering on the monkey wards sign, brightening a little to help out the contrast, and getting a perspective without the trees.  Very strong on topic...good job!  7 Lisa', '2002-07-29 11:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
