(97698, 3933, 2352, '<td valign="top">This could have been a terrific shot at perhaps a different time of day for better lighting.  And perhaps a different angle to cut out the distracting trees and lights,  just capturing the age and collapse of an empire...  You had the idea, just not the time put into it...</td>', 'This could have been a terrific shot at perhaps a different time of day for better lighting.  And perhaps a different angle to cut out the distracting trees and lights,  just capturing the age and collapse of an empire...  You had the idea, just not the time put into it...', '2002-07-29 22:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
