(97760, 3937, 2, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool photo.  Two suggestions:  1- saturate the colors a little more.  Quickly playing around with the levels in Photoshop, I was really happy to see this with bold blues and reds. 2 - the diagonal line that runs kind of crooked and points to the bottom right of the picture ... I think it would be great if the crop was right at that point, leading to the corner.  Still, this is a really visually appealing shot, and I really love geometrically based photographs.  Great negative space, too.</td>', 'This is a really cool photo.  Two suggestions:  1- saturate the colors a little more.  Quickly playing around with the levels in Photoshop, I was really happy to see this with bold blues and reds. 2 - the diagonal line that runs kind of crooked and points to the bottom right of the picture ... I think it would be great if the crop was right at that point, leading to the corner.  Still, this is a really visually appealing shot, and I really love geometrically based photographs.  Great negative space, too.', '2002-07-29 01:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97761, 3937, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting photo, but it doesn''t say ''corporate world'' without the title... - jmsetzler</td>', 'interesting photo, but it doesn''t say ''corporate world'' without the title... - jmsetzler', '2002-07-29 02:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97762, 3937, 2586, '<td valign="top">Don''t understand the title. Did you try to convey that even when the telecom industry has gone to hell, its landmarks are still standing??? This is a nice image, like the diagonal line but when my eye goes up on the landmark there isn''t much to hold interest. Good job though!</td>', 'Don''t understand the title. Did you try to convey that even when the telecom industry has gone to hell, its landmarks are still standing??? This is a nice image, like the diagonal line but when my eye goes up on the landmark there isn''t much to hold interest. Good job though!', '2002-07-29 04:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97763, 3937, 2798, '<td valign="top">A little oblique to the subject matter - but a good quality shot.</td>', 'A little oblique to the subject matter - but a good quality shot.', '2002-07-29 09:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
