(97833, 3944, 1003, '<td valign="top">thats what i do with what little i have...</td>', 'thats what i do with what little i have...', '2002-07-29 17:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97834, 3944, 1569, '<td valign="top">I think you fooled the auto focus--I can''t see any coin edges that are in focus.A brace or a tripod would have made this one much better.</td>', 'I think you fooled the auto focus--I can''t see any coin edges that are in focus.A brace or a tripod would have made this one much better.', '2002-07-29 21:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97835, 3944, 2791, '<td valign="top">love those coins :)</td>', 'love those coins :)', '2002-07-30 06:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97836, 3944, 2798, '<td valign="top">It''s not clear enough that this is a matress we''re looking under. The focus is lacking and the lighting is also flat and uninteresting. Your idea, though is more original than most.</td>', 'It''s not clear enough that this is a matress we''re looking under. The focus is lacking and the lighting is also flat and uninteresting. Your idea, though is more original than most.', '2002-07-30 09:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97837, 3944, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is just a great picture  anti corporation, anti investment and just like my father Composition is perfect, although my father would have neatly placed everything in note and coin denomination order - each to their own.  Gets a high score from me because it made me smile and conveyed the message beautifully (10)  Good luck with a great picture</td>', 'This is just a great picture  anti corporation, anti investment and just like my father Composition is perfect, although my father would have neatly placed everything in note and coin denomination order - each to their own.  Gets a high score from me because it made me smile and conveyed the message beautifully (10)  Good luck with a great picture', '2002-07-30 10:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97838, 3944, 573, '<td valign="top">Very topical for the challenge.  I don''t see the detail I would expect for this image, did you use any sharpening in your post procesing?  When I read the title with a heavy Italian accent, I hava to maka one''a my top a'' picks.</td>', 'Very topical for the challenge.  I don''t see the detail I would expect for this image, did you use any sharpening in your post procesing?  When I read the title with a heavy Italian accent, I hava to maka one''a my top a'' picks.', '2002-07-30 12:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
