(97840, 3944, 1005, '<td valign="top">Check your spelling (see title).  So this is a slam on the banking corporations?  A better bet than the stock market?  It''s a loose connection, but no looser than mine, so I can accept it, but will it be universally accepted?  Clarity and lighting are both acceptable, cute title, marginal interest (pun back at you!)  6 Swash</td>', 'Check your spelling (see title).  So this is a slam on the banking corporations?  A better bet than the stock market?  It''s a loose connection, but no looser than mine, so I can accept it, but will it be universally accepted?  Clarity and lighting are both acceptable, cute title, marginal interest (pun back at you!)  6 Swash', '2002-07-30 20:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
