(97844, 3944, 811, '<td valign="top">Good idea (picture not hiding money under the mattress -- side story.  Old man here in my community did that.  House burned down.  The found one tin can with $2,500 in it.  That''s all he had left -- the rest burned.  Nothing to do with the qualityof your picture though, sorry.)  Anyway.  I think the focus needs to be a little sharper on the money, and it needs some more color, somehow, maybe a bright sheet on the top mattress. karmat</td>', 'Good idea (picture not hiding money under the mattress -- side story.  Old man here in my community did that.  House burned down.  The found one tin can with $2,500 in it.  That''s all he had left -- the rest burned.  Nothing to do with the qualityof your picture though, sorry.)  Anyway.  I think the focus needs to be a little sharper on the money, and it needs some more color, somehow, maybe a bright sheet on the top mattress. karmat', '2002-08-03 13:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97845, 3944, 737, '<td valign="top">Composition - good. I think this is a matress.<br/>Technical Aspects - good. i think the DOF could be larger<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality - good<br/></td>', 'Composition - good. I think this is a matress.Technical Aspects - good. i think the DOF could be largerMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality - good', '2002-08-04 23:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
