(97847, 3945, 1856, '<td valign="top">I love the uniqueness of this photo.  Where you''ve placed the items is nice but I wish the cooler bag wasn''t in this...maybe a portable patent leather bar (we all have those laying around).  Other little things to make the stuffed suit look a little more snooty and detached from the ''real'' world would be nice.   I''d also like to see a tighter crop.  Can you believe I can nitpick that much and still think this deserves an 8?  :P Good job!  Lisa<br/></td>', 'I love the uniqueness of this photo.  Where you''ve placed the items is nice but I wish the cooler bag wasn''t in this...maybe a portable patent leather bar (we all have those laying around).  Other little things to make the stuffed suit look a little more snooty and detached from the ''real'' world would be nice.   I''d also like to see a tighter crop.  Can you believe I can nitpick that much and still think this deserves an 8?  :P Good job!  Lisa', '2002-07-29 15:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(97848, 3945, 2752, '<td valign="top">very clever useof symbols and good design</td>', 'very clever useof symbols and good design', '2002-07-29 18:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
