(175923, 3888, 4648, '<td valign="top">On the forum you commented that most of yours were B&amp;W and the first one I look at is colored and I love it.  It''s so typical and IT"S IN COLOR, BEAUTIFUL in color.  Did you try it in B&amp;W.  Bet it was nothing.<br/>I do really like this and it is so well done, beautiful focus and not too sharp.  Handing out the bag made this for you.  Otherwise it was any drive through any where.  Everyone recognized that "M".  First time submission - ain''t half bad.  I''d a given it an 8 myself if I''d been on line back then.  Do some more in color, you do well with it.</td>', 'On the forum you commented that most of yours were B&W and the first one I look at is colored and I love it.  It''s so typical and IT"S IN COLOR, BEAUTIFUL in color.  Did you try it in B&W.  Bet it was nothing.I do really like this and it is so well done, beautiful focus and not too sharp.  Handing out the bag made this for you.  Otherwise it was any drive through any where.  Everyone recognized that "M".  First time submission - ain''t half bad.  I''d a given it an 8 myself if I''d been on line back then.  Do some more in color, you do well with it.', '2002-12-20 22:31:34.000000', NULL, 0),
